tino : I Love Navidad (3jours)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"en":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"it":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad (3jours)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"cn":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad (3jours)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"fr":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad","shortdescr":"Un march\u00e9 de No\u00ebl vraiment pas comme les autres. On y chante, on y danse et on y trouve des produits uniques, dans une ambiance qui vous r\u00e9chauffera le c\u0153ur. \nAvec I Love Navidad, Vous ne verrez plus les march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl de la m\u00eame mani\u00e8re.","longdescr":"Le March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl le plus caliente de Belgique revient !\n\n\"I Love Navidad\" va encore ambiancer la capitale. Pas un, pas deux mais trois jours de festivit\u00e9s hivernales sur fond de cultures latinos en plein \"Bruselas\".\n\nDe l\u2019Equateur au Br\u00e9sil, en passant par le P\u00e9rou, la Colombie, Cuba, etc. Le traineau du P\u00e8re No\u00ebl vous emm\u00e8nera dans recoins insoup\u00e7onn\u00e9s.\n\nUn moment toujours magique pour les enfants que sauront aussi appr\u00e9cier les plus grands.\n\n\u00b0Au menu : de l'artisanat, des sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9s culinaires typiques de No\u00ebl, Dj's, et artistes les plus d'hiver d\u00e9fileront sur la sc\u00e8ne de la Place Van Meenen. Tout est garanti 100% latino !\n\u00b0Quand ? Les 13,14 & 15 d\u00e9cembre.\n\u00b0O\u00f9 ? Place Van Meenen (devant l'h\u00f4tel de ville de Saint-Gilles)\n\nL\u2019entr\u00e9e est gratuite, le d\u00e9paysement aussi. Venez en famille et\/ou entre amis.\n\nFeliz Navidad, Amigos y Amigas.","performers":"Des artistes venus du monde entier ! Brandon Montoya (Colombie - reggaeton), Nito Lascano (Equateur - cumbia), Valdo Vinoz (Mexique - Pop), Centavito Jr (Equateur - pasillo) et bien d'autres.\nEt Papa No\u00ebl en guest-star, of course.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"sp":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad (3jours)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"},"nl":{"name":"March\u00e9 de No\u00ebl Latino : I Love Navidad","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/FestivaliLoveEcuador","email":"EcuadorpalmundoASBL@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004305"}},"place":{"id":278198,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Markt auf dem Place Van Meenen  ","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Der Wochenmarkt auf dem Place Van Meenen findet jeden Montagnachmittag von 12:00 bis 19:00 Uhr (bei sch\u00f6nem Wetter sogar bis 19:30 Uhr!) auf dem Vorplatz des prunkvollen Rathauses von Saint-Gilles statt. Hier gibt es hochwertige regionale Produkte zu erschwinglichen Preisen. Hauptanziehungspunkt ist dabei die gro\u00dfe Auswahl an Bio-Obst und -Gem\u00fcse, K\u00e4se, Geb\u00e4ck und anderen Leckereien. Hier geht es gesellig zu und Marktbesucher, Feinschmecker, Familien, Einheimische und Besucher treffen sich bei typischer Atmosph\u00e4re auf der eigenen Markt-Terrasse, wo man sich ein Gl\u00e4schen oder ein kleines H\u00e4ppchen g\u00f6nnt. Ein charmanter Markt, wo der Wocheneinkauf richtig Spa\u00df bringt! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":" March\u00e9 Place Van Meenen","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Place Van Meenen Market","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"The market on place Van Meenen takes place every Monday afternoon from 12:00am to 07:00pm (07:30pm when the weather is good!) in front of Saint-Gilles town hall. It brings together producers and traders around great local produce at affordable prices. People flock here for its wide selection of organic fruit and vegetables, cheeses, pastries and other sweet treats. Gourmets like to meet there and enjoy its friendly, local atmosphere and its perfect terrace for having a drink among friends accompanied by delicious produce purchased on the market. It\u2019s an unmissable moment of sharing! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":" March\u00e9 Place Van Meenen","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":" March\u00e9 Place Van Meenen","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":" March\u00e9 Place Van Meenen","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Le march\u00e9 de la Place Van Meenen a lieu tous les lundis apr\u00e8s-midi de 12h00 \u00e0 19h00 (19h30 quand il fait beau !) en face de la maison communale de Saint-Gilles. Il rassemble producteurs et commer\u00e7ants autour de bons produits du terroir \u00e0 des prix abordables. On s\u2019y presse pour son large choix de fruits et de l\u00e9gumes biologiques, de fromages, de p\u00e2tisseries et autres douceurs. Dans une ambiance conviviale, les gourmands aiment s\u2019y donner rendez-vous pour son atmosph\u00e8re typique et sa terrasse id\u00e9ale pour partager un verre entre amis accompagn\u00e9 de quelques d\u00e9lices acquis sur  le march\u00e9. Un moment de partage \u00e0 ne manquer sous aucun pr\u00e9texte ! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":" March\u00e9 Place Van Meenen","address_street_name":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Place Maurice Van Meenen","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Markt op het Van Meenenplein  ","address_street_name":"Maurice Van Meenenplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Maurice Van Meenenplein","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Elke maandagnamiddag van 12 tot 19 uur (19.30 uur als het mooi weer is!) is het markt op het Van Meenenplein, tegenover het gemeentehuis van Sint-Gillis. Producenten en handelaars brengen er hun kwaliteitsvolle lokale voeding aan de man, tegen schappelijke prijzen. Mensen komen er graag voor de ruime keuze aan biologische groenten en fruit, kaas, gebak en andere zoetigheden. Fijnproevers spreken er graag af voor de gezellige sfeer, en de terrasjes eromheen zijn ideaal om iets te gaan drinken met vrienden terwijl je de lekkernijen proeft die je net op de markt kocht. Je beleeft er ongetwijfeld een gezellige tijd ! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":38198,"location":{"lat":50.82503286,"lon":4.34598905},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-13T15:07:25+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50000537,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ecuador Pa'l Mundo","address_street_name":"Vanderschrick","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"begoeders@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/settings?tab=profile&section=username&view","phone_contact":"+32 473 48 27 13","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Vanderschrick, 66","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Ecuador Pa'l Mundo","address_street_name":"Vanderschrick","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"begoede