mblez through words and images","shortdescr":"On the occasion of the 100th anniversary of Surrealism, Wittockiana pays tribute to Jacques Lacomblez (Brussels, 1934), who is celebrating his 90th birthday. The exhibition reveals a new aspect of his work, dedicated to the artist's books, illustrations and poems. ","longdescr":"On the occasion of the 100th anniversary of Surrealism, Wittockiana pays tribute to Jacques Lacomblez (Brussels, 1934), who is celebrating his 90th birthday. The exhibition reveals a new aspect of his work, dedicated to the artist's books and papers. Discover his rare editions, original texts, illustrations, and limited editions, as well as his refined bookbinding designs. These works, both underground cathedrals and cabinets of curiosities, testify to Lacomblez's unique imaginative power, a true heir of the Surrealist movement. A total immersion in the poetic and dreamlike world of this unmissable Belgian artist!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/en\/home-en\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"},"it":{"name":"Jacques lacomblez through words and images","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"},"cn":{"name":"Jacques lacomblez through words and images","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"},"fr":{"name":"Jacques Lacomblez en mots et en images","shortdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019occasion des 100 ans du Surr\u00e9alisme, la Wittockiana rend hommage \u00e0 Jacques Lacomblez (Bruxelles, 1934), qui f\u00eate ses 90 ans. L\u2019exposition d\u00e9voile un volet in\u00e9dit de son \u0153uvre, consacr\u00e9 aux livres, illustrations et po\u00e8mes de l\u2019artiste.","longdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019occasion des 100 ans du Surr\u00e9alisme, la Wittockiana rend hommage \u00e0 Jacques Lacomblez (Bruxelles, 1934), qui f\u00eate ses 90 ans. L\u2019exposition d\u00e9voile un volet in\u00e9dit de son \u0153uvre, consacr\u00e9 aux livres et papiers de l\u2019artiste.\nVenez d\u00e9couvrir ses \u00e9ditions rares, textes originaux, illustrations et tirages de t\u00eate, ainsi que ses d\u00e9cors de reliures finement travaill\u00e9s: ses \u0153uvres, \u00e0 la fois cath\u00e9drales souterraines et cabinets de curiosit\u00e9s, t\u00e9moignent de l\u2019imagination unique de Lacomblez, v\u00e9ritable h\u00e9ritier du mouvement surr\u00e9aliste.\nUne immersion totale dans l\u2019univers po\u00e9tique et onirique de cet artiste belge incontournable !\n","performers":"\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"},"sp":{"name":"Jacques lacomblez through words and images","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"},"nl":{"name":"Jacques Lacomblez in woord en beeld","shortdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van de 100e verjaardag van het surrealisme brengt de Wittockiana een eerbetoon aan Jacques Lacomblez (Brussel, 1934), die zijn 90e verjaardag viert. De tentoonstelling onthult een nieuw aspect van zijn werk, gewijd aan de boeken, illustraties en gedichten van de kunstenaar.","longdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van de 100e verjaardag van het surrealisme brengt de Wittockiana een eerbetoon aan Jacques Lacomblez (Brussel, 1934), die zijn 90e verjaardag viert. De tentoonstelling onthult een nieuw aspect van zijn werk, gewijd aan de boeken en werk op papier van de kunstenaar.\nOntdek zijn zeldzame uitgaven, originele teksten, illustraties en edities, evenals zijn verfijnde boekbandontwerpen. Deze werken, als ondergrondse kathedralen en rariteitenkabinetten, getuigen van de unieke verbeeldingskracht van Lacomblez, een ware erfgenaam van de surrealistische beweging.\nEen totale onderdompeling in de po\u00ebtische en droomachtige wereld van deze onmisbare Belgische kunstenaar!\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/nl\/home-nl\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002770"}},"place":{"id":142,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Wittockiana: Msueum f\u00fcr Buch- und Buchbindekunst","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Rue du Bemel, 23","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"Die Wittockiana wurde 1983 von dem renommierten Buchkenners Michel Wittock gegr\u00fcndet und ist sowohl Buchmuseum als auch Bibliothek und Archiv f\u00fcr kostbare historische, moderne und zeitgen\u00f6ssische B\u00fccher.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Wittockiana : Mus\u00e9e des Arts du livre et de la Reliure ","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"ht