 promises you an unforgettable and extraordinary experience.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/book\/","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/interactive.visrez.com\/the-hotel-brussels\/","visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 38","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 38","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 38","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bienvenue \u00e0 The Hotel Brussels, un havre de luxe nich\u00e9 au coeur de la ville. Plongez dans des vues panoramiques, savourez des commodit\u00e9s modernes et d\u00e9couvrez un service d'exception. Profitez de notre emplacement id\u00e9al \u00e0 deux pas des principales attractions, et laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par nos 422 chambres et suites \u00e9l\u00e9gantes. Profitez de notre centre de fitness et spa au 23e \u00e9tage, et des d\u00e9lices culinaires de notre restaurant et bar, The Iris. Les clients des chambres Deluxe Panorama, des suites Panorama et Splendour b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d'un acc\u00e8s exclusif au Panorama Lounge au 24e \u00e9tage, offrant des collations gratuites et une vue sur la ville et le palais de justice. Que vous soyez ici pour affaires ou pour le plaisir, The Hotel Brussels vous promet une exp\u00e9rience inoubliable et extraordinaire.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/book\/","sort_order":"The Hotel Brussels","virtual_visit":"https:\/\/interactive.visrez.com\/the-hotel-brussels\/","visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 38","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Waterloolaan","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Waterloolaan, 38","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Welkom bij The Hotel Brussels, een luxe toevluchtsoord in het hart van de stad. Dompel uzelf onder in panoramische uitzichten, geniet van moderne voorzieningen en ervaar uitzonderlijke service. Profiteer van onze ideale locatie op slechts een steenworp afstand van belangrijke bezienswaardigheden, en laat u betoveren door onze 422 elegante kamers en suites. Geniet van ons fitnesscentrum en spa op de 23e verdieping, en de culinaire hoogstandjes van ons restaurant en bar, The Iris. Gasten die verblijven in Deluxe Panorama kamers, Panorama Suites en Splendour Suites profiteren van exclusieve toegang tot de Panorama Lounge op de 24e verdieping, met gratis snacks en uitzicht op de stad en het Justitiepaleis. Of u nu hier bent voor zaken of plezier, The Hotel Brussels belooft u een onvergetelijke en buitengewone ervaring.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/book\/","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/interactive.visrez.com\/the-hotel-brussels\/","visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[10],"translations":{"de":["Louise"],"pt":[null],"en":["Louise"],"it":["Louise"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Louise"],"sp":["Louise"],"nl":["Louiza"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":41154,"location":{"lat":50.8373682,"lon":4.3572089},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-08-26T11:22:02+02:00","published_at":"2023-08-23T09:38:34+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50000410,"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_street_number":"38","address_street_box":null,"email":"book@thehotel.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thehotel-brussels.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 504 11 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard de Waterloo, 38","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"The Hotel Brussels","address_street_name":"Boulevard de Waterloo","address_str