 state-of-the-art Fablab, a digital library and more.\r\nWe support artistic and creative practices using (digital) technologies as their medium. Next to providing support for artists in their experimentation-, research- and production processes, iMAL is hosting art exhibitions, conferences, performances. Furthermore we also facilitates critical reflection, research and debates around the current and future challenges of our technological society, by stimulating cross-pollinations between art and technology.\r\nWith our wide range of activities and elaborated mediation program, we aim to empower people and inspire the next generations to actively participate in today and future digital cultures. Our Fablab encourages social inclusion and innovation towards sustainable development within the local community of Molenbeek.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"IMAL, CENTER FOR DIGITAL CULTURES AND TECHNOLOGY","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"iMAL, Center for Digital Cultures and Technology","address_street_name":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@imal.org","website":"http:\/\/www.imal.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 30 93","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai des Charbonnages","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booki