98"},"pt":{"name":"Bleach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"en":{"name":"Bleach","shortdescr":"Until January 18, 2025, in Brussels, Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e is exhibiting and selling original drawings from the anime Bleach, created by the animators from Studio Pierrot.\n","longdescr":"\nAfter the successful exhibitions dedicated to Naruto, One Piece, and Dragon Ball, it's the turn of fans of the Bleach anime to also have a world premiere!\n\nThis is in fact the very first time that an art gallery has exhibited and put on sale layouts, dogas and gengas from this successful series, a successful adaptation of the manga Bleach by Tite Kubo.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"it":{"name":"Bleach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"cn":{"name":"Bleach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"fr":{"name":"Bleach - Dessins originaux de l'anime","shortdescr":"Jusqu\u2019au 18 janvier 2025, \u00e0 Bruxelles, la Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e expose et met en vente des dessins originaux de l\u2019anime Bleach, r\u00e9alis\u00e9s par les animateurs du Studio Pierrot.\n","longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s les expositions \u00e0 succ\u00e8s consacr\u00e9es \u00e0 Naruto, One Piece, et Dragon Ball, c\u2019est au tour des fans de l\u2019anime Bleach d\u2019avoir eux aussi une premi\u00e8re mondiale !\n\nC\u2019est en effet la toute premi\u00e8re fois qu\u2019une galerie d\u2019art expose et met en vente des layouts, dogas et gengas de cette s\u00e9rie \u00e0 succ\u00e8s, adaptation r\u00e9ussie du manga Bleach de Tite Kubo, publi\u00e9 en France par Gl\u00e9nat.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"sp":{"name":"Bleach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/anime-tite-kubo-bleach\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002698"},"nl":{"name":"Bleach - Verkooptentoonstelling - Originele tekeningen van de anime","shortdescr":"\nTot 18 januari 2025 exposeert en verkoopt de Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e in Brussel originele tekeningen uit de anime Bleach, gemaakt door de animators van Studio Pierrot.","longdescr":"Na de succesvolle tentoonstellingen gewijd aan Naruto, One Piece en Dragon Ball, is het nu de beurt aan fans van de Bleach-anime om ook een wereldpremi\u00e8re te beleven!\n\nDit is in feite de allereerste keer dat een kunstgalerie lay-outs, doga's en genga's uit deze succesvolle serie, een succesvolle bewerking van de manga Bleach van Tite Kubo.","performers":n