contemporary art that that talks to everyone at a universal language. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Whether you are an experienced collector or just beginning to explore the world of art, for professional purpose or private collection, we have something to offer. Our collection features a diverse selection of high-quality artwork, ranging from contemporary to traditional pieces. We carefully curate each piece to ensure that it meets our high standards of quality and excellence.\r\n \r\n\u2022 At Art Y\u012b, in addition to our exceptional collection,we are committed to providing our clients with an unparalleled experience. Acquiring a work of art is a unique moment. In order to make this magic possible, Art Y\u012b offers different financing solutions like Art Leasing and\/or Art Renting with an option to buy that can best fit professional profile and acquire art in additional advantages. Our team of experts is always available to provide personalized guidance and assistance, from selecting the perfect piece to finding the best financial solutions.\r\n \r\n\u2022 At Art Y\u012b, we are passionate about art and committed to providing our clients with the very best. Join us on our mission to bring art to the world and discover the exclusive advantages of collecting art with us: \r\n- Receive our personalized membership offer for your 1st Collection !\r\n- Enjoy Free Global Art Shipping\r\n- Have first access to our New Arts & Exhibitions\r\n- Attend our Vernigssages & Art fairs with VIP Entry","description_print":"\u2022 Located at Monts des Arts Museum area and Brussels-Central station, close to the Grand-Place, Art Y\u012b is a contemporary art gallery that receives millions of international tourists passing by every year and serve art collectors from all over the world.\r\n \r\n\u2022 Art Y\u012b offers a unique experience of contemporary art from different cultures. The gallery showcases a wide selection of sculptures and paintings from Europe and Asia. Founded by Shuo LIU, Art Y\u012b has a rich heritage of a 40 years of Belgian gallery.\r\n\r\nOur 5 categories\r\n\u2022 Sculptures\r\n\u2022 Paintings\r\n\u2022 Installation art\r\n\u2022 Ceramics\r\n\u2022 Antiques\r\n\r\n\u2022 An art of fusion, a travel from tradition to contemporary, from the East to the West, leading to a diversity that live outside time and space. We propose a unique version of contemporary art that that talks to everyone at a universal language. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Whether you are an experienced collector or just beginning to explore the world of art, for professional purpose or private collection, we have something to offer. Our collection features a diverse selection of high-quality artwork, ranging from contemporary to traditional pieces. We carefully curate each piece to ensure that it meets our high standards of quality and excellence.\r\n \r\n\u2022 At Art Y\u012b, in addition to our exceptional collection,we are committed to providing our clients with an unparalleled experience. Acquiring a work of art is a unique moment. In order to make this magic possible, Art Y\u012b offers different financing solutions like Art Leasing and\/or Art Renting with an option to buy that can best fit professional profile and acquire art in additional advantages. Our team of experts is always available to provide personalized guidance and assistance, from selecting the perfect piece to finding the best financial solutions.\r\n \r\n\u2022 At Art Y\u012b, we are passionate about art and committed to providing our clients with the very best. Join us on our mission to bring art to the world and discover the exclusive advantages of collecting art with us: \r\n- Receive our personalized membership offer for your 1st Collection !\r\n- Enjoy Free Global Art Shipping\r\n- Have first access to our New Arts & Exhibitions\r\n- Attend our Vernigssages & Art fairs with VIP Entry","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/www.art-yi.com","visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Art Yi