"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"},"it":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"},"cn":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"},"fr":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","shortdescr":"Le WOM, un voyage interactif pour troubler vos sens. D\u00e9couvrez un mus\u00e9e d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux perceptions et aux illusions \u00e0 la crois\u00e9e des sciences et de l'amusement.","longdescr":"D\u00e9fiez votre cerveau avec le WOM !\n\nSitu\u00e9 \u00e0 Tour & Taxis dans un espace de pr\u00e8s de 1 500m\u00b2, le WOM \u201cWorld of Mind\u201d vous invite pour une exp\u00e9rience rythm\u00e9e, pleine de surprises et riche en \u00e9motions dans un parcours immersif sur les perceptions et les illusions.\n\nPlus de 80 illusions visuelles, tactiles et auditives vous attendent, de quoi questionner la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 dans un univers interactif \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique color\u00e9e.\n\nRetrouvez le neurologue Steven Laureys dans les corners de science tout au long du parcours, pour en apprendre plus sur les cinq sens et le fonctionnement de notre cerveau de mani\u00e8re ludique et surprenante !\n\nHoraires :\nHORS VACANCES SCOLAIRES ET JOURS F\u00c9RI\u00c9S : ouvert du mardi au dimanche de 10h \u00e0 18h\nVACANCES SCOLAIRES ET JOURS F\u00c9RI\u00c9S : ouvert tous les jours de 10h \u00e0 18h\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"},"sp":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"},"nl":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","shortdescr":"Het WOM, een interactieve reis die je zintuigen helemaal in de war brengt. Ontdek een museum gewijd aan percepties en illusies op het kruispunt van wetenschap en plezier.","longdescr":"Daag je hersenen uit in het WOM!\n\nHet WOM (World of Mind) nodigt je uit voor een ritmische ervaring vol verrassingen en rijk aan emoties in een meeslepende reis over percepties en illusies. Dit alles op een oppervlakte van meer dan 1.500m\u00b2, gelegen op de hippe Tour & Taxis-site.\n\nMeer dan 80 visuele, tactiele en auditieve illusies wachten op je. Deze ervaringen stellen de werkelijkheid in vraag in een interactief universum met een kleurrijke esthetiek.\n\nOntmoet ook neuroloog Steven Laureys in de wetenschapshoeken, om op een leuke en verrassende manier meer te weten te komen over de vijf zintuigen en de werking van onze hersenen!\n\n\nOpeningstijden: \nUITSCHAKELINGEN EN VAKANTIJDEN: open dinsdag tot zondag van 10u tot 18u \nSCHOOLVAKANTIE EN VAKANTIJDEN: elke dag open van 10u tot 18u","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/worldofmind.be","email":"info@worldofmind.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 549 60 49","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553913"}},"place":{"id":280014,"translations":{"de":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Challenge your brain at the WOM!\r\n\r\nDas WOM (World of Mind) l\u00e4dt Sie zu einem rhythmischen Erlebnis voller \u00dcberraschungen und reich an Emotionen in einer immersiven Reise \u00fcber Wahrnehmungen und Illusionen ein. All dies auf einer Fl\u00e4che von mehr als 1 500 m\u00b2 im trendigen Tour & Taxis-Gel\u00e4nde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 80 visuelle, taktile und auditive Illusionen erwarten Sie. Diese Erfahrungen stellen die Realit\u00e4t in einem interaktiven Universum mit einer farbenfrohen \u00c4sthetik in Frage.\r\n\r\nTreffen Sie auch den Neurologen Steven Laureys auf der Wissenschaftsecke, um auf unterhaltsame und \u00fcberraschende Weise mehr \u00fcber die f\u00fcnf Sinne und die Funktionsweise unseres Gehirns zu erfahren!\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 13","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Challenge your brain at the WOM!\r\n\r\nIn a museum of 1500m\u00b2, exercise your senses and challenge your brain in a colourful universe! Dedicated to the five senses, our perceptions and illusions, the WOM is scientific but also recreational. \r\nIt's an exceptional experience which questions reality as we perceive it and where science meets fun!\r\n\r\nDiscover famous illusions such as the mirror room or the vortex but also experiences never seen before in Belgium. Get ready for a visit full of surprises and emotions!\r\n\r\nThroughout your visit, meet the well-known neurologist, author and Francqui Prize winner Steven Laureys in the Science Corners. Learn about the five senses, the way our brain works, and discover what happens when we interact with illusions and how we treat the information sent by our environment.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"D\u00e9fiez votre cerveau avec le WOM !\r\n\r\nSitu\u00e9 \u00e0 Tour & Taxis dans un espace de plus de 1 500m\u00b2, le WOM \u201cWorld of Mind\u201d vous invite pour une exp\u00e9rience rythm\u00e9e, pleine de surprises et riche en \u00e9motions dans un parcours immersif sur les perceptions et les illusions.\r\n\r\nPlus de 80 illusions visuelles, tactiles et auditives vous attendent, de quoi questionner la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 dans un univers interactif \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique color\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nRetrouvez le neurologue Steven Laureys dans les corners de science tout au long du parcours, pour en apprendre plus sur les cinq sens et le fonctionnement de notre cerveau de mani\u00e8re ludique et surprenante !\r\n","description_print":"D\u00e9fiez votre cerveau avec le WOM !\r\nSitu\u00e9 \u00e0 Tour & Taxis dans un espace de plus de 1 500m\u00b2, le WOM \u201cWorld of Mind\u201d vous invite pour une exp\u00e9rience rythm\u00e9e, pleine de surprises et riche en \u00e9motions dans un parcours immersif sur les perceptions et les illusions. \t\r\nPlus de 60 illusions visuelles, tactiles et auditives vous attendent, de quoi questionner la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 dans un univers interactif \u00e0 l\u2019esth\u00e9tique color\u00e9e.\r\nRetrouvez le neurologue Steven Laureys dans les corners de science tout au long du parcours, pour en apprendre plus sur les cinq sens et le fonctionnement de notre cerveau de mani\u00e8re ludique et surprenante !\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 13","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Prikkel je brein in het WOM!\r\n\r\nHet WOM (World of Mind) nodigt je uit voor een ritmische ervaring vol verrassingen en rijk aan emoties in een meeslepende reis over percepties en illusies. Dit alles op een oppervlakte van meer dan 1.500m\u00b2, gelegen op de hippe Tour & Taxis-site.\r\n\r\nMeer dan 80 visuele, tactiele en auditieve illusies wachten op je. Deze ervaringen stellen de werkelijkheid in vraag in een interactief universum met een kleurrijke esthetiek.\r\n\r\nOntmoet ook neuroloog Steven Laureys in de wetenschapshoeken, om op een leuke en verrassende manier meer te weten te komen over de vijf zintuigen en de werking van onze hersenen!\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":40014,"location":{"lat":50.8643214,"lon":4.3441104},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-07-23T12:40:18+02:00","published_at":"2023-03-01T14:50:58+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":280014,"translations":{"de":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Challenge your brain at the WOM!\r\n\r\nDas WOM (World of Mind) l\u00e4dt Sie zu einem rhythmischen Erlebnis voller \u00dcberraschungen und reich an Emotionen in einer immersiven Reise \u00fcber Wahrnehmungen und Illusionen ein. All dies auf einer Fl\u00e4che von mehr als 1 500 m\u00b2 im trendigen Tour & Taxis-Gel\u00e4nde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 80 visuelle, taktile und auditive Illusionen erwarten Sie. Diese Erfahrungen stellen die Realit\u00e4t in einem interaktiven Universum mit einer farbenfrohen \u00c4sthetik in Frage.\r\n\r\nTreffen Sie auch den Neurologen Steven Laureys auf der Wissenschaftsecke, um auf unterhaltsame und \u00fcberraschende Weise mehr \u00fcber die f\u00fcnf Sinne und die Funktionsweise unseres Gehirns zu erfahren!\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@worldofmind.be","website":"http:\/\/www.worldofmind.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 549 60 49","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"WOM - World Of Mind","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":nul