228"},"pt":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"en":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":"Embark on a colourful daydream through the backstreets and clubs of Buenos Aires.\nIguaz\u00fa Quintet is a young Belgian ensemble made up of multi-faceted musicians offering a modern vision of Tango Nuevo. Together, they explore new territories through a host of original arrangements punctuated by improvisation.\n","longdescr":"Iguaz\u00fa Quintet was born in 2016 at the Royal Conservatory of Mons (Arts2), and has since developed as a professional project between classical music, tango and jazz, on Belgian stages and abroad.\nAfter recording a first album dedicated to Astor Piazzolla, released in 2020, the group will release its new album \u2018Passages\u2019 in July 2023, dedicated to contemporary composers of Tango Nuevo, pursuing an artistic trajectory mixing musical genres and positioning itself as a \u2018Chamber Jazz\u2019 group.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"it":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"cn":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"fr":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":"Embarquez pour un r\u00eave \u00e9veill\u00e9 et color\u00e9, le long des ruelles et des clubs de Buenos Aires.\nIguaz\u00fa Quintet est un jeune ensemble belge compos\u00e9 de musicien.nes multifacettes et proposant une vision moderne du Tango Nuevo. Ensemble, ielles explorent de nouveaux territoires \u00e0 travers de nombreux arrangements originaux ponctu\u00e9s d'improvisation\n","longdescr":"Iguaz\u00fa Quintet a vu le jour en 2016 au sein du Conservatoire Royal de Mons (Arts2), et s'est depuis d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 comme projet professionnel entre musique classique, tango et jazz, sur les sc\u00e8nes belges et \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger.\nApr\u00e8s l'enregistrement d'un premier album d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 Astor Piazzolla, paru en 2020, le groupe sort en Juillet 2023 son nouvel album \"Passages\", d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 des compositeurs contemporains du Tango Nuevo,  poursuivant une trajectoire artistique m\u00e9langeant les genres musicaux et se positionnant comme une formation de \"Jazz de Chambre\".","performers":"Iguazu quintet, Violon - Marion Borgel , Accord\u00e9on - Pauline Oreins, Guitares - Wynand Mawet ,Piano - Hakim Talbi,  Basse - Nicolas Sanna","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"sp":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"},"nl":{"name":"A new age of tango","shortdescr":"Ga mee op een kleurrijke dagdroom door de achterafstraatjes en clubs van Buenos Aires.\nIguaz\u00fa Quintet is een jong Belgisch ensemble dat bestaat uit veelzijdige muzikanten die een moderne visie op Tango Nuevo geven. Samen verkennen ze nieuwe gebieden door middel van originele arrangementen die door improvisatie worden onderbroken.\n","longdescr":"Het Iguaz\u00fa Quintet werd geboren in 2016 aan het Koninklijk Conservatorium van Mons (Arts2) en heeft zich sindsdien ontwikkeld als een professioneel project tussen klassieke muziek, tango en jazz, op Belgische podia en in het buitenland.\nNa het opnemen van een eerste album gewijd aan Astor Piazzolla, uitgebracht in 2020, zal de groep in juli 2023 zijn nieuwe album \u201cPassages\u201d uitbrengen, gewijd aan hedendaagse componisten van Tango Nuevo, een artistiek traject nastreven dat muziekgenres mengt en zich positioneert als een \u201cChamber Jazz\u201d groep","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004228"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@lebaixu.com","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36