Fest: ETERNAL RETURN","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Ictus & Delle Donne Consort","shortdescr":"The Coudenberg Palace presents the fourth edition of Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, an eclectic festival where music meets history. Artists from Brussels and beyond will enchant their audience in this unique archaeological site in the heart of Europe. \n","longdescr":"The Coudenberg Palace presents the fourth edition of Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, an eclectic festival where music meets history. Artists from Brussels and beyond will enchant their audience in this unique archaeological site in the heart of Europe. \n\nThe four double concerts take place every Sunday evening from 24\/11 until 15\/12 2024 and will celebrate consort music in all its forms and instrumental combinations, from string and keyboard ensembles to saxophone and recorder quartets. \n\nSun 15 Dec 18.30\nETERNAL RETURN \u2013 Between attraction and repulsion\nIctus (Eva Reiter and Geert de Bi\u00e8vre) (BE) & Delle Donne Consort (BE)\nMusic by L. Berio, J. de Sainte-Colombe, J. de Prez, E. Reiter, C. de Rore et al.\n\nIctus (Eva Reiter, viola da gamba, Geert de Bi\u00e8vre, cello)\nDelle Donne Consort (Frederike Van Lindt, Lieve De Sadeleer, Kinga Ludvai, Serena Agosto, recorders)\nIctus duo between composer and violist Eva Reiter and cellist Geert De Bi\u00e8vre, presents a programme of musical contrasts, albeit with great discretion and intimacy. The ostensible contrast between the two instruments, the modern cello and the viola da gamba, gives energy to the concert. By feigning to oppose modern and ancient, Berio and Sainte-Colombe, nostalgia and innovation, the cello and the gamba da viola, this concert pays subtle homage to an eternal desire of music, and its most ancient and universal function: the art of the half-said.\n\nThe Belgian ensemble Delle Donne Consort presents a polyphonic love story with a toxic twist, exploring diverse 16th-century love themes from the Italian Renaissance, embodied in the Neapolitan Villanelles and their unique influence on Western music. The romantic tale begins with a passionate yet naive attraction, abruptly disrupted by unexpected repulsion. This shift triggers a range of emotions, from serious doubts and tragic love stories to sparkling pastoral scenes and true love.\n\nThis concert is 1 of 4 - each on Sunday evenings from 18:30. They will take place on 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 and 15\/12. More info on: https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: ETERNAL RETURN","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"cn":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: ETERNAL RETURN","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"fr":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Ictus & Delle Donne Consort","shortdescr":"Le Palais du Coudenberg pr\u00e9sente la quatri\u00e8me \u00e9dition du Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, un festival \u00e9clectique o\u00f9 la musique rencontre l'histoire. Des artistes de Bruxelles et d'ailleurs enchanteront leur public dans ce site arch\u00e9ologique unique au c\u0153ur de l'Europe. ","longdescr":"Le Palais du Coudenberg pr\u00e9sente la quatri\u00e8me \u00e9dition du Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, un festival \u00e9clectique o\u00f9 la musique rencontre l'histoire. Des artistes de Bruxelles et d'ailleurs enchanteront leur public dans ce site arch\u00e9ologique unique au c\u0153ur de l'Europe. \n\nLes quatre concerts doubles ont lieu tous les dimanches soirs du 24\/11 au 15\/12 2024 et c\u00e9l\u00e9breront la musique de consort sous toutes ses formes et combinaisons instrumentales, des ensembles \u00e0 cordes et claviers aux quatuors de saxophones et de fl\u00fbtes \u00e0 bec.\n\nDim 15 d\u00e9c 18h30\nRETOUR \u00c9TERNEL \u2013 Entre attraction et r\u00e9pulsion\nIctus (Eva Reiter et Geert de Bi\u00e8vre) (BE) & Delle Donne Consort (BE)\nMusique de L. Berio, J. de Sainte-Colombe, J. de Prez, E. Reiter, C. de Rore, etc.\n\nIctus (Eva Reiter, viole de gambe; Geert de Bi\u00e8vre, violoncelle)\nDelle Donne Consort (Frederike Van Lindt, Lieve De Sadeleer, Kinga Ludvai, Serena Agosto, fl\u00fbtes \u00e0 bec)\n\nLe duo Ictus, compos\u00e9 de la compositrice et violiste Eva Reiter et du violoncelliste Geert De Bi\u00e8vre, pr\u00e9sente un programme de contrastes musicaux avec grande discr\u00e9tion et intimit\u00e9. Le contraste apparent entre les deux instruments, le violoncelle moderne et la viole de gambe ancienne, donne de l'\u00e9nergie au concert. En feignant d'opposer le moderne et l'ancien, Berio et Sainte-Colombe, la nostalgie et l'innovation, ce concert rend hommage subtilement \u00e0 un d\u00e9sir \u00e9ternel de la musique et \u00e0 sa fonction la plus ancienne et universelle : l'art du demi-dit.\n\nL'ensemble belge Delle Donne Consort pr\u00e9sente une histoire d'amour polyphonique avec une tournure toxique, explorant les divers th\u00e8mes amoureux du XVIe si\u00e8cle, incarn\u00e9s dans les Villanelles napolitaines et leur influence unique sur la musique occidentale. Cette histoire romantique commence par une attraction passionn\u00e9e mais na\u00efve, brusquement interrompue par une r\u00e9pulsion inattendue, d\u00e9clenchant une gamme d'\u00e9motions allant de doutes s\u00e9rieux et d'histoires d'amour tragiques \u00e0 des sc\u00e8nes pastorales p\u00e9tillantes et au v\u00e9ritable amour.\n\nCe concert est le premier d'une s\u00e9rie de 4 - chacun des dimanches soirs \u00e0 partir de 18h30. Ils auront lieu les 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 et 15\/12. Plus d'informations : https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: ETERNAL RETURN","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"},"nl":{"name":"Coudenberg Sound Box Fest: Ictus & Delle Donne Consort","shortdescr":"Het Coudenbergpaleis presenteert de vierde editie van Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, een eclectisch festival waar muziek en geschiedenis elkaar ontmoeten. Artiesten uit Brussel en daarbuiten zullen hun publiek betoveren in deze unieke archeologische site in het hart van Europa. ","longdescr":"Het Coudenbergpaleis presenteert de vierde editie van Coudenberg Sound Box Fest, een eclectisch festival waar muziek en geschiedenis elkaar ontmoeten. Artiesten uit Brussel en daarbuiten zullen hun publiek betoveren in deze unieke archeologische site in het hart van Europa. \n\nDe vier dubbelconcerten, elke zondagavond van 24\/11 tot en met 15\/12, vieren consortmuziek in al zijn vormen en instrumentale combinaties, van ensembles van strijk- en toetsinstrumenten tot saxofoon- en blokfluitkwartetten. \n\nZo 15 dec 18.30\nETERNAL RETURN \u2013 Tussen aantrekking en afstoting\nIctus (Eva Reiter en Geert de Bi\u00e8vre) (BE) & Delle Donne Consort (BE)\nMuziek van L. Berio, J. de Sainte-Colombe, J. de Prez, E. Reiter, C. de Rore, enz.\n\nIctus (Eva Reiter, viola da gamba; Geert de Bi\u00e8vre, cello)\nDelle Donne Consort (Frederike Van Lindt, Lieve De Sadeleer, Kinga Ludvai, Serena Agosto, blokfluiten)\n\nHet Ictus-duo, bestaande uit componist en gambist Eva Reiter en cellist Geert De Bi\u00e8vre, presenteert een programma van muzikale contrasten, zij het met grote discretie en intimiteit. Het schijnbare contrast tussen de twee instrumenten, de moderne cello en de oude viola da gamba, geeft energie aan het concert. Door te veinzen dat modern en antiek, Berio en Sainte-Colombe, nostalgie en vernieuwing, de cello en de gamba da viola tegenover elkaar staan, brengt dit concert een subtiel eerbetoon aan een eeuwig verlangen naar muziek en haar oudste en meest universele functie: de kunst van het halfgezegde.\n\nHet Belgische ensemble Delle Donne Consort presenteert een polyfoon liefdesverhaal met een giftige twist, waarin diverse 16e-eeuwse liefdesthema's uit de Italiaanse Renaissance worden verkend, belichaamd in de Napolitaanse Villanelles en hun unieke invloed op de westerse muziek. Het romantische verhaal begint met een gepassioneerde maar na\u00efeve aantrekkingskracht, die abrupt wordt verstoord door een onverwachte afkeer. Deze verschuiving roept een scala aan emoties op, van ernstige twijfels en tragische liefdesverhalen tot sprankelende pastorale sc\u00e8nes en ware liefde.\n\nDit concert is er 1 van 4 - telkens op zondagavond vanaf 18:30. Ze vinden plaats op 24\/11, 1\/12, 8\/12 en 15\/12. Meer info op: https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/csbf2024","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002447"}},"place":{"id":50002549,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Koningsplein, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Koningsplein, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":43293,"location":{"lat":50.8428945,"lon":4.3597604},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-10-18T11:27:00+02:00","published_at":"2024-10-18T11:27:00+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":258195,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una exposici\u00f3n permanente de objetos hallados durante las distintas excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":18195,"location":{"lat":50.8426107,"lon":4.3606882},"last_updated_at":"2024-06-14T16:22:27+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-05T10:58:29+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"i