"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"},"it":{"name":"Un l\u00e9ger doute","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"},"cn":{"name":"Un l\u00e9ger doute","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"},"fr":{"name":"Un L\u00e9ger Doute","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Avec la pi\u00e8ce \u00ab Un l\u00e9ger doute \u00bb, St\u00e9phane De Groodt et son c\u00e9l\u00e8bre sens de l\u2019absurde font des merveilles. Un moment de th\u00e9\u00e2tre captivant o\u00f9 la fronti\u00e8re entre la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 et la fiction s\u2019estompe !\nQue devient un acteur ou une com\u00e9dienne lorsqu\u2019il n\u2019y a plus de public pour faire vivre leurs personnages ? Plus grand chose, ou presque\u2026 Mais lorsque le rideau se rel\u00e8ve, s\u2019agit-il de la com\u00e9die qui se joue ou de la vie qui reprend ses droits ? Alors entre fiction et r\u00e9alit\u00e9, on ne sait plus qui est qui\u2026\nAvec ce voyage en absurdie au cocktail d\u00e9tonnant, ce l\u00e9ger doute vous emm\u00e8ne dans le monde singulier, mais pluriel de St\u00e9phane De Groodt dont c\u2019est la premi\u00e8re pi\u00e8ce. Le spectacle est jalonn\u00e9 de multiples situations, procurant au spectateur un vertige d\u00e9licieux et inattendu. \u00ab Un l\u00e9ger doute \u00bb est une com\u00e9die aux accents existentiels et \u00e0 la fantaisie absurde, qui explore des th\u00e9matiques importantes avec brio.\nLa mise en sc\u00e8ne est illumin\u00e9e par des interpr\u00e8tes hors pair, et les r\u00e9pliques pleines d\u2019esprit ne laisseront pas le public indiff\u00e9rent.","performers":"UN L\u00c9GER DOUTE\nUne pi\u00e8ce de St\u00e9phane De Groodt\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Lippmann\nAvec St\u00e9phane De Groodt, Constance Doll\u00e9, Pascal Demolon et Anne Beno\u00eet\nCostumes : Laurent Mercier\nLumi\u00e8res : Jean-Pascal Pracht\nAssistante \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne : Lou G\u00e9linas\nMusique : Pablo Lanty\nSc\u00e9nographie :  Jacques Gabel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"},"sp":{"name":"Un l\u00e9ger doute","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"},"nl":{"name":"Un L\u00e9ger Doute","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kimaimemesuive.fr","email":"sybilleiweins@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 477 27 50 55","phone_booking":"+32 477 27 50 55","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003233"}},"place":{"id":329,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Circo reale","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A gest\u00e3o art\u00edstica do local, assegurada durante muito tempo pelo Jardim Bot\u00e2nico, foi atribu\u00edda \u00e0 Brussels Expo. A programa\u00e7\u00e3o musical permanecer\u00e1 o foco, embora a dan\u00e7a, o teatro e a \u00f3pera fa\u00e7am apari\u00e7\u00f5es espor\u00e1dicas na arena. Sem esquecer o circo, arte a que foi inicialmente dedicada esta sala, como o seu nome ainda recorda.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This former circus built in 1878 is probably one of the nicest venues in Brussels. The artistic management of the site, long granted by the Botanique, is in the hands of Brussels Expo now. Music programming remains the central activity, however, dance, theater or opera sometimes invest its arena too. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseig