"de":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Jazz e Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Jazz y blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Jazz & Blues","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"pt":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"en":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":"Every Wednesday, a concert followed by a jam session featuring the best jazz musicians from Brussels and beyond. A unique atmosphere, expertly managed by the leading association in the field, a high-quality bar, and fiery solos create the perfect recipe for a successful evening","longdescr":"Every Wednesday, don\u2019t miss the chance to immerse yourself in the enchanting world of jazz with an exceptional concert followed by a lively jam session. The best jazz musicians, whether from Brussels or beyond, come together to deliver an unforgettable musical evening. Every note, every solo is an invitation to be swept away by the magic of the moment. But that\u2019s not all: the atmosphere is carefully crafted by an association renowned for its expertise and passion for jazz, ensuring a unique experience each time. To top it all off, a high-quality bar offers carefully selected drinks to accompany the fiery solos that resonate throughout the space. Let yourself be captivated by this magical recipe for a successful evening, where music, ambiance, and enjoyment converge. ","performers":"Program details : popupjazzclub.brussels on Instagram ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"it":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"cn":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"fr":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":"Tous les mercredi, un concert suivi d'une jam session avec les meilleurs musicien.ne.s de jazz de Bruxelles et d'ailleurs. Une ambiance unique g\u00e9r\u00e9 par l'association de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence en la mati\u00e8re, un bar de haute qualit\u00e9 et des solos endiabl\u00e9s sont la recette magique d'une soir\u00e9e r\u00e9ussie. Tous les mercredis. ","longdescr":"Tous les mercredis, ne manquez pas l\u2019occasion de plonger dans l\u2019univers envo\u00fbtant du jazz avec un concert exceptionnel suivi d'une jam session. Les meilleurs musiciens de jazz, qu\u2019ils viennent de Bruxelles ou d\u2019ailleurs, se r\u00e9unissent pour vous offrir une soir\u00e9e musicale inoubliable. Chaque note, chaque solo est une invitation \u00e0 vous laisser emporter par la magie du moment. Mais ce n\u2019est pas tout : l\u2019ambiance est soigneusement orchestr\u00e9e par une association reconnue pour son expertise et sa passion du jazz, vous garantissant une exp\u00e9rience unique \u00e0 chaque fois. Pour couronner le tout, un bar de haute qualit\u00e9 vous propose des boissons soigneusement s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9es pour accompagner les solos endiabl\u00e9s qui r\u00e9sonnent dans la salle. Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par cette recette magique, celle d\u2019une soir\u00e9e r\u00e9ussie, o\u00f9 la musique, l\u2019ambiance et le plaisir se rencontrent.","performers":"Program details : popupjazzclub.brussels on Instagram ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"sp":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"},"nl":{"name":"The Hang!","shortdescr":"Elke woensdag een concert, gevolgd door een jamsessie met de beste jazzmuzikanten uit Brussel en daarbuiten. Een unieke sfeer, georganiseerd door de toonaangevende vereniging op dit gebied, een hoogwaardige bar en vurige solo's vormen het magische recept voor een geslaagde avond.","longdescr":"Elke woensdag is het d\u00e9 kans om je te laten onderdompelen in de betoverende wereld van jazz met een uitzonderlijk concert, gevolgd door een levendige jamsessie. De beste jazzmuzikanten, of ze nu uit Brussel of van elders komen, komen samen om je een onvergetelijke muzikale avond te bezorgen. Elke noot, elk solo is een uitnodiging om je te laten meevoeren door de magie van het moment. Maar dat is nog niet alles: de sfeer wordt zorgvuldig georkestreerd door een vereniging die bekend staat om haar expertise en passie voor jazz, wat je elke keer weer een unieke ervaring garandeert. En om het geheel af te ronden, biedt een bar van hoge kwaliteit zorgvuldig geselecteerde drankjes aan die perfect passen bij de vurige solo's die door de ruimte weerklinken. Laat je verleiden door dit magische recept voor een geslaagde avond, waar muziek, sfeer en plezier samenkomen. Elke woensdag is het d\u00e9 afspraak die je niet mag missen.","performers":"Program details : popupjazzclub.brussels on Instagram ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/popupjazzclub.brussels\/","email":"joachim.popupjazz@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001131"}},"place":{"id":275426,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Full Circle","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Vleurgat","address_street_number":"89","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fullcircle.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.fullcirclespaces.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 37 77","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Vleurgat, 89","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Full Circle","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Vleurgat","address_street_number":"89","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fullcircle.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.fullcirclespaces.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 37 77","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Vleurgat, 89","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Full Circle","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Vleurgat","address_street_number":"89","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fullcircle.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.f