,"email":"institut@arabe-culture.com","website":"https:\/\/www.arabe-culture.com\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 64 74","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de l'Alliance, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Institut Europ\u00e9en de la Culture Arabe","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Alliance","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"institut@arabe-culture.com","website":"https:\/\/www.arabe-culture.com\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 64 74","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de l'Alliance, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"\nInstitut la\u00efque, culturel et acad\u00e9mique, totalement ind\u00e9pendant de tous pouvoirs ou repr\u00e9sentations ethniques, politiques ou de culte, pratiquant le libre examen et attentif \u00e0 toute expression de pens\u00e9e respectant les droits de l'Homme et des Peuples, se mouvant dans le respect absolu de l'\u00eatre humain et de ses droits, l\u2019Institut est inter-communautaire en ce qui concerne ses objectifs et ses pratiques, il exerce ses activit\u00e9s dans deux principaux secteurs :\n\n\u200b\n\n1. Les \u00e9changes linguistiques et l\u2019initiation \u00e0 la culture et \u00e0 la civilisation arabes, sous forme d\u2019animations et de formation acad\u00e9mique:\n\na) Enseigner la langue arabe selon les crit\u00e8res d\u00e9finis par le Conseil de l\u2019Europe en ce qui concerne l\u2019apprentissage des langues.\n\nb) Enseigner la culture arabe avec les diff\u00e9rents savoir-faire de cette culture en respectant les niveaux r\u00e9put\u00e9s \u00e9tablis dans la mati\u00e8re choisie selon des crit\u00e8res scientifiques bien d\u00e9termin\u00e9s.\n\n\u200b\u200b2. La participation au rayonnement de la culture arabe par le biais de la production, de la diffusion, de la cr\u00e9ation et de l\u2019\u00e9dition.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel Arabe","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Alliance","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"institut@arabe-culture.com","website":"https:\/\/www.arabe-culture.com\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 64 74","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de l'Alliance, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Europees Instituut voor Arabische Cultuur","address_street_name":"Verbondsstraat","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"arabisch-centrum@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.culture-arabe.irisnet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 64 74","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Verbondsstraat, 2","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5889,"location":{"lat":50.8544587,"lon":4.3708841},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-11-13T10:17:39+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:19:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":246372,"translations":{"de":{"name":"AWSA-Be","address_street_name":"r.du M\u00e9ridien","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"awsabe@gmai