,"longdescr":"Et depuis\nNous sommes avec cette question\nComment dire je suis ci ou \u00e7a ?\nJe suis qui je suis\nJe suis un, je suis mille et plus encore\nIl y a une guitare\nUn accord\u00e9on\nEt nous allons chemin\nQuitte \u00e0 nous perdre\nDans l\u2019immensit\u00e9 de l\u2019\u00eatre...","performers":"Mise en sc\u00e8ne : Thierry Lef\u00e8vre\nAssistant \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne : Juan Martinez\nRegards ext\u00e9rieurs : Aude Dierkens, Delphine Veggiotti\nInterpr\u00e9tation : Le\u00efla Chaarani et Alexandre Duvinage\nSuivi de production : Christine Cloarec \/ Quai 41\nDiffusion : Mathias Rouche \/ diffusion@unecompagnie.be","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/tes-qui-toi\/2024-12-27\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003425"},"sp":{"name":"T'es qui toi ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/tes-qui-toi\/2024-12-27\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003425"},"nl":{"name":"T'es qui toi ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/tes-qui-toi\/2024-12-27\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003425"}},"place":{"id":4,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20"