ebrate the New Year\u2019s Eve at the iconic Grand Casino of Brussels, THE VIAGE.\n\n","longdescr":"New Years Eve Party Viva Las Vegas The Viage - Grand Casino Brussels\nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/953963526590549\/\n\nMB PRESENTS, JUST A NIGHT, GIN JEUDI, EXPATS IN BRUSSELS & VIBKES are delighted to invite you to celebrate the New Year\u2019s Eve at the iconic Grand Casino of Brussels, THE VIAGE.\n\nOur theme for this year is Viva Las Vegas! What Happens in Vegas Stays in Vegas\u2026 shuuush! If you are curious to find out, be there.\n\nPrivatized Venue \/ 22:00\u201304:00 Party at Grand Casino Brussels (the grand theatre on the 4th floor)\nInternational crowd\nLine-up with Elis (Place Lux, VIBkes, Bar Mardi,...) & Jonathan Loys (Justanight)\nProfessional photographer.\nNovelties, serpentine, confetti.\nVIP tables upon request: gin.jeudi@gmail.com\nParking nearby\n\nDoors open at 22:00. Get your tickets online to avoid the queue.\nPresale tickets >>> https:\/\/vivalasvegascasino.eventbrite.be\nor >>> Tickets available online or at the door.\n\nBooking fees included! Payments for this event are non-refundable.\n\nBefore the party, we're hosting a Gala Dinner at Radisson Collection Grand Place Brussels, only a 2-minute walk from the Grand Casino Brussels.\n\nThe package includes the dinner at Radisson Collection and access to the party at the Grand Casino. Book here: https:\/\/www.eventbrite.com\/e\/1090949522389\n\nDRESS CODE: NYE chic & sexy classy Vegas style\n\nLet the New Year begin in Vegas... shuuush...\n\nVenue: The Viage : Boulevard Anspach 30, Brussels, Belgium","performers":"CasinoofBrussels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/953963526590549\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004294"},"sp":{"name":"New Year Party 31.12 : Viva Las Vegas at The Viage (Grand Theatre of the Brussels Casin