mers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"pt":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"en":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":"On December 13th and 14th, Commons Hub Brussels transforms into a cozy, compassionate Christmas market! Discover local, vegan, and sustainable vendors, enjoy live music, and spread holiday cheer through interactive activities","longdescr":"On December 13th and 14th, celebrate the season of giving at Merry Kindmas\u2014a unique, cozy, and compassionate Christmas market showcasing the best in local, sustainable, and vegan vendors. Join us on Friday from 6-10 PM and Saturday from 12-10 PM at Commons Hubs Brussels, where kindness takes center stage!\nDiscover thoughtful gifts, delicious vegan treats, and eco-friendly finds, and take part in interactive kindness activities & talks. Warm up with jolly music, sip on seasonal drinks, and leave inspired to spread holiday cheer far beyond the season.\nWhether you\u2019re shopping, crafting, or sharing in the spirit of kindness, Merry Kindmas is an event where every purchase and every gesture makes a difference: we will donate 10% percent of all proceeds to charities in need. Bring your loved ones and be part of a holiday market that\u2019s truly merry, kind, and memorable!\n\nFree entry | Family-friendly | Vegan & Eco-Conscious","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"it":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"cn":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"fr":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":"Les 13 et 14 d\u00e9cembre, le Commons Hub Bruxelles se transforme en un march\u00e9 de No\u00ebl chaleureux et bienveillant ! Venez d\u00e9couvrir des stands locaux, v\u00e9g\u00e9taliens et \u00e9coresponsables, profiter de musique live et participer \u00e0 des activit\u00e9s interactives.","longdescr":"Les 13 et 14 d\u00e9cembre, c\u00e9l\u00e9brez la saison du partage \u00e0 Merry Kindmas\u2014un march\u00e9 de No\u00ebl unique, chaleureux et solidaire mettant en avant les meilleurs artisans locaux, durables et v\u00e9g\u00e9taliens. Rejoignez-nous vendredi de 18h \u00e0 22h et samedi de 12h \u00e0 22h au Commons Hub Bruxelles, o\u00f9 la bienveillance est \u00e0 l'honneur !\n\nD\u00e9couvrez des cadeaux r\u00e9fl\u00e9chis, des d\u00e9lices v\u00e9g\u00e9taliens et des trouvailles \u00e9coresponsables, et participez \u00e0 des activit\u00e9s interactives et des discussions inspirantes autour de la gentillesse. R\u00e9chauffez-vous au son d'une musique joyeuse, sirotez des boissons de saison et repartez inspir\u00e9\u00b7e pour diffuser la magie des f\u00eates bien au-del\u00e0 de la saison.\n\nQue vous veniez pour faire vos achats, cr\u00e9er des objets ou partager l'esprit de g\u00e9n\u00e9rosit\u00e9, Merry Kindmas est un \u00e9v\u00e9nement o\u00f9 chaque achat et chaque geste compte : 10 % des recettes seront revers\u00e9s \u00e0 des associations dans le besoin. Venez avec vos proches et participez \u00e0 un march\u00e9 de No\u00ebl vraiment joyeux, solidaire et m\u00e9morable !\n\nEntr\u00e9e gratuite | Pour toute la famille | V\u00e9g\u00e9talien & \u00c9coresponsable","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"sp":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"},"nl":{"name":"Merry Kindmas! A Christmas Market with Heart","shortdescr":"Op 13 en 14 december verandert Commons Hub Brussel in een knusse, hartelijke kerstmarkt! Ontdek lokale, veganistische en duurzame standhouders, geniet van livemuziek en verspreid kerstvreugde met interactieve activiteiten.","longdescr":"Op 13 en 14 december vieren we het seizoen van geven bij Merry Kindmas\u2014een unieke, knusse en hartelijke kerstmarkt met het beste van lokale, duurzame en veganistische standhouders. Kom langs op vrijdag van 18u tot 22u en zaterdag van 12u tot 22u in Commons Hub Brussel, waar vriendelijkheid centraal staat!\n\nOntdek doordachte cadeaus, heerlijke vegan lekkernijen en milieuvriendelijke vondsten, en neem deel aan interactieve activiteiten en inspirerende gesprekken over vriendelijkheid. Warm op met vrolijke muziek, geniet van feestelijke drankjes en laat je inspireren om de kerstvreugde verder te verspreiden dan de feestdagen alleen.\n\nOf je nu komt winkelen, knutselen of het goede doel wilt steunen, Merry Kindmas is een evenement waar elke aankoop en elke daad een verschil maakt: we doneren 10% van de opbrengst aan goede doelen die het nodig hebben. Breng je geliefden mee en beleef een kerstmarkt die echt vrolijk, vriendelijk en onvergetelijk is!\n\nGratis toegang | Kindvriendelijk | Vegan & Duurzaam","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.veganbrussels.com","email":"hello@veganbrussels.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004024"}},"place":{"id":50002673,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Commons Hub","address_street_name":"Rue de la Madeleine","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@commonshub.brussels","website":"https:\/\/commonshub.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Madeleine, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Commons Hub","address_street_name":"Rue de la Madeleine","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@commonshub.brussels","website":"https:\/\/commonshub.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Madeleine, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Commons Hub","address_street_name":"Magdalenasteenweg","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@commonshub.brussels","website":"https:\/\/commonshub.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Magdalenasteenweg, 51","address_line2":"1000