s":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"en":{"name":"Fishbowl \/ Bigre","shortdescr":"A laugh-out-loud-silent comedy","longdescr":"Once upon a time today, in three small attic apartments in\nParis, a big man, a tall thin man and a curvaceous blonde\nare neighbours. This would be a romantic story if it wasn\u2019t\nfor the fact that these three odd-balls have a special talent\nfor messing things up. Messing everything up. With one\ndisaster leading to another amidst a deluge of jokes, this\nquirky trio cling to anything that looks like love, life or hope.\nIn a Grand-Guignolesque performance, objects fly around,\ncharacters fall flat on their faces and the whole stage is in\ntotal disarray from the various fires, leaks, storms and other\nwhacky unexpected accidents that culminate in a dizzying\nchaos. Endearing, laugh-inducing and irresistible, our three\nanti-heroes shock us just as much as they make us cry...\nwith laughter.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"it":{"name":"Bigre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"cn":{"name":"Bigre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"fr":{"name":"Bigre","shortdescr":"M\u00e9lo burlesque.","longdescr":"Il \u00e9tait une fois, aujourd\u2019hui, dans une grande ville, trois petites chambres habit\u00e9es par trois personnes dont le destin serait de tout rater. Mais de tout rater merveilleusement.\nIls ne partagent qu'un palier. En voisins. Trois chambres de bonne, avec chiottes communes et sons aff\u00e9rents. Deux hommes et une femme, isol\u00e9s, chacun dans son monde. Il y a le geek psychorigide, le baba cool bord\u00e9lique et l'apprentie en m\u00e9decines douces. Ils font l'\u00e9preuve d'une promiscuit\u00e9 ponctu\u00e9e de dingueries. Pas une parole dans cet immeuble o\u00f9 tout part en vrille et s'envole, poubelles et sous-v\u00eatements. Des chants, des cris, des bruits. Trois clowns du d\u00e9sastre urbain apprennent \u00e0 vivre ensemble. Et \u00e7a d\u00e9g\u00e9n\u00e8re, jusqu'au cataclysme.","performers":"Avec en alternance Pierre Guillois ou Bruno Fleury, Agathe L\u2019Huillier ou E\u0301le\u0301onore Auzou-Connes ou Anne Cressent, Jonathan Pinto-Rocha ou Olivier Martin-Salvan\nAssistant artistique Robin Causse ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"sp":{"name":"Bigre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"},"nl":{"name":"Bigre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012524"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Ukkel","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 3