alse,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-12-13T01:01:44+01:00","published_at":"2024-10-24T12:52:52+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":310425,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":0.5503212081491045,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"pt":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"en":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"it":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"cn":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"fr":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"En 1837, \u00e0 Paris, rue du Marais, se trouvait une myst\u00e9rieuse boutique dont la vitrine \u00e9tait toujours dissimul\u00e9e derri\u00e8re d\u2019\u00e9normes rideaux rouges. Un simple \u00e9critau pr\u00e9cisait qu\u2019on pouvait y louer un d\u00e9guisement le temps d\u2019un bal costum\u00e9 ou d\u2019une soir\u00e9e mondaine. Etrangement, ce magasin n\u2019ouvrait qu\u2019\u00e0 la tomb\u00e9e de la nuit, \u00e0 l\u2019heure o\u00f9 les autres commerces baissent leurs rideaux et o\u00f9 les gens de bonne vie rentrent chez eux. La nuit venue, profitant du brouillard et de la faible lueur des r\u00e9verb\u00e8res, des silhouettes furtives y p\u00e9n\u00e9traient, non sans h\u00e9sitation. Les pires rumeurs couraient forc\u00e9ment sur cet \u00e9tablissement. On parlait d\u2019orgies et de meurtres rituels\u2026 Et puis, de nombreux clients n\u2019en \u00e9taient jamais ressortis\u2026 Il faut dire que le boutiquier \u00e9tait un vieil homme \u00e9trange et fort peu affable ; il avait un regard per\u00e7ant et on le disait pourvu de dons surnaturels. Lorsqu\u2019on l\u2019interrogeait sur sa profession, il se disait changeur\u2026 Alors que venaient donc chercher dans cette \u00e9trange masure ces belles aristocrates et ces petits bourgeois au regard perdu ? Forc\u00e9ment bien plus qu\u2019une transformation passag\u00e8re. Puisqu\u2019on raconte aussi qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019arri\u00e8re de l\u2019\u00e9choppe se trouvait une porte d\u00e9rob\u00e9e qui menait vers d\u2019autres univers dont le vieil homme \u00e9tait, semble-t-il, le gardien.\n\nC\u2019est un nouveau conte de no\u00ebl que vous propose la troupe du Magic land, une histoire sur la transformation et sur d\u2019autres possibles, parce que du r\u00eave \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9, lorsqu\u2019on le veut vraiment, il n\u2019y a parfois qu\u2019une porte \u00e0 franchir.\n\nDur\u00e9e: 1h30\n\nOUVERTURE DES PORTES : 19:30\nD\u00c9BUT DU SPECTACLE : 20:00\nFIN APPROXIMATIVE : 21:40","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"sp":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"},"nl":{"name":"18 Rue du Marais","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","email":"johanne@magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 26 18 71","phone_booking":"+32 495 26 18 71","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002959"}},"place":{"id":224842,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Rue d'Hoogvorst","address_street_number":"8-14","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magicland-theatre.com","website":"http:\/\/www.magicland-theatre.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 245 50 64","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue d'Hoogvorst, 8-14","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The Magic Land Th\u00e9\u00e2tre was born out of a collective dream in the 1970s. It now has its\r\nactive, around fifty creations, several international tours and participation regular at most major Belgian cultural events. His multiple exp\u00e9riences artistic works carried out on so many fronts have allowed him to forge a style so particular, far removed off the beaten track of classical theater. If we had to classify the \"Magic land\" in a category \" popular theater \"is undoubtedly the adjective which would suit best even if Patrick Chaboud its founder prefers to speak of a theater of exchanges, meetings, surprises, debates, emotions and forcing anger sometimes too. At the Magic land theater, the scenic barriers conventional have long since been abolished in order to build bridges between genders, heater, dance, music, circus, humor. The Magic Land Theater is ultimately, above all, a living theater, a theater in perpetual \"reinvention\" to better ward off ideas black.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit