ndfulness from the Middle Ages \u2013 The Imitatio Christi 1424 - 2024","shortdescr":"Pop-up expo about Thomas a Kempis' Imitatio Christi","longdescr":"The Imitatio Christi has been a global bestseller for 600 years. After the Bible, it is the most distributed and widely read book in the world. This spiritual self-help book teaches you, through biblical quotes and the wisdom of philosophers, Church Fathers, and mystics, how to find deep inner peace and attempts to answer the universal question: how to live? It is a story of devotion and mindfulness, of light from the not-so-dark Middle Ages.\n\nKBR treasures more than 1000 manuscripts and prints of the Imitatio Christi, including the autograph that Thomas a Kempis kept until his death\u2014a collection that reflects nearly the entire history of the printing press. From 20 November to 20 December 2024, you can admire them in a pop-up exhibition at the Librarium on level -2.\n\nAdmission is free.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/en\/agenda\/mindfulness-from-the-middle-ages-the-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"},"it":{"name":"Mindfulness uit de Middeleeuwen \u2013 De Imitatio Christi 1424 -2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/evenement\/meditations-medievales-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"},"cn":{"name":"Mindfulness uit de Middeleeuwen \u2013 De Imitatio Christi 1424 -2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/evenement\/meditations-medievales-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"},"fr":{"name":"M\u00e9ditations M\u00e9di\u00e9vales - L'Imitatio Christi 1424 -2024","shortdescr":"Pop-up expo sur l'Imitatio Christi de Thomas a Kempis","longdescr":"L'Imitatio Christi est un best-seller mondial depuis le XVe si\u00e8cle. C'est le livre le plus diffus\u00e9 et le plus lu apr\u00e8s la Bible. Par ailleurs, ce livre vieux de 600 ans est toujours d'actualit\u00e9. Il s'agit en effet d'un livre de d\u00e9veloppement personnel spirituel qui vous enseigne, \u00e0 travers des citations de la Bible et la sagesse de philosophes, de p\u00e8res de l'\u00c9glise et de mystiques, comment trouver une paix int\u00e9rieure profonde. Le livre tente aussi de r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 la question universelle : comment vivre.\n\nKBR conserve pr\u00e9cieusement des centaines d'exemplaires de l'Imitatio Christi, dont l'ouvrage autographe que Thomas a Kempis aurait gard\u00e9 jusqu'\u00e0 sa mort. Du 20 novembre au 20 d\u00e9cembre 2024, KBR organise une expo pop-up sur ce livre dans le Librarium, \u00e0 l'\u00e9tage -2.\n\nL'entr\u00e9e est gratuite.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/evenement\/meditations-medievales-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"},"sp":{"name":"Mindfulness uit de Middeleeuwen \u2013 De Imitatio Christi 1424 -2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/evenement\/meditations-medievales-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"},"nl":{"name":"Mindfulness uit de Middeleeuwen \u2013 De Imitatio Christi 1424 -2024","shortdescr":"Pop-up expo over de Imitatio Christi van Thomas a Kempis","longdescr":"De Imitatio Christi is al 600 jaar lang een wereldwijde bestseller. Na de Bijbel is het het meest verspreide en gelezen boek ter wereld. Het spirituele zelfhulpboek leert u via bijbelcitaten en wijsheden van filosofen, kerkvaders en mystici hoe u diepe innerlijke rust kan vinden en probeert antwoord te geven op de universele vraag: hoe te leven? Een verhaal van devotie en mindfulness, van licht uit de niet zo duistere middeleeuwen.\n\nKBR koestert meer dan 1000 handschriften en drukken van de Imitatio Christi, waaronder de autograaf die Thomas a Kempis tot zijn dood heeft bewaard, een collectie die zowat de volledige geschiedenis van de boekdrukkunst weerspiegelt. Van 20 november tot 20 december 2024 kan u ze bewonderen in een pop-up expo in het Librarium op verdieping -2.\n\nDe toegang is gratis.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kbr.be\/nl\/evenement\/mindfulness-uit-de-middeleeuwen-de-imitatio-christi-1424-2024\/","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003455"}},"place":{"id":981,"translations":{"de":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address