ull,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/fr\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"en":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":"argos is proudly taking part in Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924) - a touring film programme that is collectively curated and presented by fifteen international arts organisations. This year, the AFI partners have commissioned or selected recent artists\u2019 films, which respond to the theme \u2018solidarity\u2019. ","longdescr":"argos is proudly taking part in Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924) - a touring film programme that is collectively curated and presented by fifteen international arts organisations and convened by Forma. AFI\u201924 introduces the work of talented moving image artists to worldwide audiences, and runs over 300 days, with exhibitions, screenings and public programmes hosted across four continents.\n\nThis year, the AFI partners have commissioned or selected recent artists\u2019 films, which respond to the theme \u2018solidarity\u2019. Considering solidarity as a collective form of resistance, togetherness and interdependence, the fifteen films in AFI\u201924 address the ways in which solidarity is needed, sought and enacted on micro and macro scales. ","performers":"Collectif Faire-Part\nBahar Arfan\nMary Sullivan\nMilica Raki\u0107\nNadeem Din-Gabisi\nCassils\nRana Nazzal Hamadeh\nAarti Sunder\nDeividas Vytautas Auk\u0161\u010di\u016bnas\nMaud Sulter\nIngrid Bj\u00f8rnaali, Maria Simmons & Fabian Lanzmaier\nPinar \u00d6\u011frenci","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/en\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"it":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/fr\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"cn":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/fr\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"fr":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":"argos participe \u00e0 Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924), un programme itin\u00e9rant de films organis\u00e9 collectivement par quinze organisations artistiques internationales. Cette ann\u00e9e, les partenaires d\u2019AFI ont s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 ou command\u00e9 des films r\u00e9cents sur le th\u00e8me de la solidarit\u00e9. ","longdescr":"argos participe \u00e0 Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924), un programme itin\u00e9rant de films organis\u00e9 collectivement par quinze organisations artistiques internationales sous la direction de Forma. AFI\u201924 pr\u00e9sente les \u0153uvres de vid\u00e9astes talentueux.se \u00e0 un public mondial.\n\nCette ann\u00e9e, les partenaires d\u2019AFI ont s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 ou command\u00e9 des films r\u00e9cents sur le th\u00e8me de la solidarit\u00e9. Envisag\u00e9e comme une forme collective de r\u00e9sistance, de coh\u00e9sion et d\u2019interd\u00e9pendance, elle est explor\u00e9e \u00e0 travers quinze films qui montrent comment elle est n\u00e9cessaire, recherch\u00e9e et mise en \u0153uvre \u00e0 diff\u00e9rentes \u00e9chelles. Le programme d\u2019AFI\u201924 suscite et nourrit des imaginaires radicaux capables de transformer notre exp\u00e9rience collective \u00e0 plus grande \u00e9chelle.","performers":"Collectif Faire-Part\nBahar Arfan\nMary Sullivan\nMilica Raki\u0107\nNadeem Din-Gabisi\nCassils\nRana Nazzal Hamadeh\nAarti Sunder\nDeividas Vytautas Auk\u0161\u010di\u016bnas\nMaud Sulter\nIngrid Bj\u00f8rnaali, Maria Simmons & Fabian Lanzmaier\nPinar \u00d6\u011frenci","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/fr\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"sp":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/fr\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"},"nl":{"name":"Artists\u2019 Film International 2024: Solidarity","shortdescr":"argos neemt deel aan Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924), een reizend filmprogramma dat collectief wordt gecureerd en gepresenteerd door vijftien internationale kunstorganisaties. Dit jaar hebben de partners recente kunstenaarsfilms geselecteerd of geproduceerd rond het thema \u2018solidariteit\u2019. ","longdescr":"argos neemt deel aan Artists\u2019 Film International (AFI\u201924), een reizend filmprogramma dat collectief wordt gecureerd en gepresenteerd door vijftien internationale kunstorganisaties onder leiding van Forma. AFI\u201924 introduceert het werk van getalenteerde videokunstenaars aan een wereldwijd publiek.\n\nDit jaar hebben de partners recente kunstenaarsfilms geselecteerd of geproduceerd rond het thema \u2018solidariteit\u2019. Solidariteit wordt hier begrepen als een collectieve vorm van verzet, saamhorigheid en onderlinge afhankelijkheid. De vijftien films in het programma belichten hoe solidariteit wordt gezocht, nodig is en tot stand komt op micro- en macroniveau.","performers":"Collectif Faire-Part\nBahar Arfan\nMary Sullivan\nMilica Raki\u0107\nNadeem Din-Gabisi\nCassils\nRana Nazzal Hamadeh\nAarti Sunder\nDeividas Vytautas Auk\u0161\u010di\u016bnas\nMaud Sulter\nIngrid Bj\u00f8rnaali, Maria Simmons & Fabian Lanzmaier\nPinar \u00d6\u011frenci","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.argosarts.org\/nl\/event\/artists-film-international-2024-solidarity","email":"info@argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004167"}},"place":{"id":228372,"translations":{"de":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Kunstzentrum Argos wurde 1989 mit dem Ziel gegr\u00fcndet, audiovisuelle Kunstformen zu f\u00f6rdern. Heute gilt das Argos, das in der N\u00e4he des Kanals im Br\u00fcsseler Stadtzentrum niedergelassen ist, als Referenz f\u00fcr diese Kunstformen. Das Programm des Hauses ist vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von audiovisuellen und visuellen Ausstellungen \u00fcber Film- und Videovorf\u00fchrungen bis hin zu Konferenzen und Perfomances.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"argos centre for audiovisuals arts","address_street_name":"Werfstraat","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Werfstraat, 13","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Founded in 1989 in Brussels, argos is an institution and resource for the presentation, production, and study of critical audiovisual arts, as well as for its distribution, conservation and restoration. argos considers the audiovisual as a primary means of looking at and understanding the world in more open and integrated ways. Supporting a multiplicity of voices in society, it fosters dialogue with a broad range of institutional and non-institutional partners, both in Brussels and beyond, and seeks new ways to engage diverse audiences. \r\n\r\nargos makes exhibitions and programmes, distributes moving image works, and builds, preserves, and discloses a prominent collection of artist films and videos. It also houses a unique media library containing a broad selection of publications, as well as the audiovisual works of the collection, which is open to both professionals and the general public. Additionally, it develops original research projects relating to significant gaps in art history and its relationship to culture and society. Through these various activities, argos aims to more fully understand the past and present of audiovisual arts, as well as provide tools to collectively imagine and shape its futures.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ARGOS, CENTRE FOR ART & MEDIA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"argos centre for audiovisuals arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Fond\u00e9 en 1989 \u00e0 Bruxelles, argos est un lieu ressource pour la pr\u00e9sentation, la production et le d\u00e9veloppement des arts audiovisuels critiques, ainsi que pour leur distribution, conservation et restauration.\r\n\r\nargos consid\u00e8re l\u2019audiovisuel comme un moyen des plus pertinents pour regarder et comprendre le monde de mani\u00e8re ouverte et int\u00e9gr\u00e9e. Soutenant les voix alternatives dans la soci\u00e9t\u00e9, il favorise le dialogue avec un large \u00e9ventail de partenaires institutionnels ou non, tant \u00e0 Bruxelles qu\u2019ailleurs. argis recherche sans cesse de nouvelles fa\u00e7ons d'impliquer et d\u2019associer les publics les plus larges.\r\n\r\nargos  con\u00e7oit des expositions et programmations, distribue les \u0153uvres audiovisuelles les plus contemporaines et critiques; sa mission par ailleurs constitue, conserve et fait conna\u00eetre un tr\u00e8s important fonds de films et de vid\u00e9os d\u2019artistes. Il comporte \u00e9galement une m\u00e9diath\u00e8que unique en son genre, ouverte aux professionnels et au grand public. Celle-ci inclut une tr\u00e8s large s\u00e9lection de publications et les \u0153uvres audiovisuelles de la collection. De plus, ARGOS d\u00e9veloppe des projets de recherche in\u00e9dits pour pallier les lacunes importantes dans l'histoire de l'art, questionnant les relations entre culture et soci\u00e9t\u00e9.\r\n\r\n\u00c0 travers ces multiples activit\u00e9s, argis a pour objectif de permettre une meilleure compr\u00e9hension du pass\u00e9 et du pr\u00e9sent des arts audiovisuels tout en fournissant les outils pour imaginer et fa\u00e7onner collectivement leur avenir.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ARGOS, CENTRE FOR ART & MEDIA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"argos centre for audiovisuals arts","address_street_name":"Werfstraat","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Werfstraat, 13","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"argos werd opgericht in 1989 in Brussel en is een instituut, en bron, voor de studie, productie en vooruitgang van kritische audiovisuele kunsten, evenals de distributie, het behoud en de restauratie ervan.\r\n\r\nargos beschouwt het audiovisuele als een belangrijk middel om op meer open en ge\u00efntegreerde manieren de wereld te bekijken en te begrijpen. We ondersteunen een veelheid aan stemmen in de samenleving en gaan in dialoog met een breed scala aan institutionele en niet-institutionele partners, zowel in Brussel als daarbuiten. Zo willen we een steeds ruimer en \u200b\u200bmeer divers publiek bij onze activiteiten betrekken.\r\n\r\n\u249c\u24ad\u24a2\u24aa\u24ae maakt tentoonstellingen en programma's, distribueert audiovisuele werken en bouwt, beheert en ontsluit een prominente collectie van kunstenaarfilms en -video's. We hebben ook een unieke mediatheek met een ruime selectie van publicaties en de audiovisuele werken van de collectie, die zowel voor professionals als het algemene publiek toegankelijk is. Daarnaast ontwikkelen we originele onderzoeksprojecten met betrekking tot vooraanstaande hiaten in de kunstgeschiedenis en de relatie ervan tot cultuur en maatschappij.\r\n\r\nVia deze verschillende activiteiten wil argos het verleden en het heden van de audiovisuele kunsten beter doorgronden, en ook instrumenten bieden om collectief hun toekomst in te beelden en opnieuw vorm te geven.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ARGOS, CENTRE FOR ART & MEDIA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":769,"location":{"lat":50.856632,"lon":4.3496322},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-06-06T14:59:20+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:47+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":228372,"translations":{"de":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Kunstzentrum Argos wurde 1989 mit dem Ziel gegr\u00fcndet, audiovisuelle Kunstformen zu f\u00f6rdern. Heute gilt das Argos, das in der N\u00e4he des Kanals im Br\u00fcsseler Stadtzentrum niedergelassen ist, als Referenz f\u00fcr diese Kunstformen. Das Programm des Hauses ist vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von audiovisuellen und visuellen Ausstellungen \u00fcber Film- und Videovorf\u00fchrungen bis hin zu Konferenzen und Perfomances.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"ARGOS centre for audivisual arts","address_street_name":"Rue du Chantier","address_street_number":"13","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@argosarts.org","website":"http:\/\/www.argosarts.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 00 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 00 03","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Chantier, 13","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booki