rations\nNatural wooden ornaments and handcrafted toys set a warm, authentic scene.\n\nPersonalized Sessions\nEach session ends with a Polaroid keepsake.","longdescr":"Complete Holiday Atmosphere\nEach room is filled with Christmas music and seasonal scents, creating a full sensory experience that enhances the festive spirit.\n\nTwo Unique Studio Rooms\nChoose from The Holiday Studio, featuring two festive backgrounds ideal for joyful moments, or The Grand No\u00ebl Suite, a 360\u00b0 vintage-inspired space with Interbelic-style charm for timeless holiday photos.\n\nEco-Friendly Decorations\nEnjoy a cozy, authentic Christmas atmosphere with natural elements like wooden ornaments, handcrafted toys, and seasonal touches.\n\nPersonalised Sessions & Polaroid Keepsake\nTailored to suit families, couples, or friends, each session ends with a complimentary Polaroid photo as a special memento of your holiday experience.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.andreivibez.com\/xmas","email":"andreiciungu@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 486 95 98 28","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004100"},"it":{"name":"Christmas Memories","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.andreivibez.com\/xmas","email":"andreiciungu@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 486 95 98 28","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004100"},"cn":{"name":"Christmas Memories","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.andreivibez.com\/xmas","email":"andreiciungu@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 486 95 98 28","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004100"},"fr":{"name":"Christmas Memories","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.andreivibe