e des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ubicado en el centro de Bruselas, en un edificio Art Nouveau construido por Victor Horta en 1906, el CBBD abri\u00f3 sus puertas el 6 de octubre de 1989. \r\n\r\nEn pocos a\u00f1os, este museo se ha convertido en una de las principales atracciones de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nCada a\u00f1o, m\u00e1s de 200.000 visitantes recorren las exposiciones permanentes y temporales que se celebran en m\u00e1s de 4.000 m 2. \r\n\r\nAunque las exposiciones contribuyen a convertir este templo en un lugar viviente, din\u00e1mico y atrayente, esta herramienta al servicio de la promoci\u00f3n del c\u00f3mic constituye un centro de documentaci\u00f3n moderno, con un cat\u00e1logo accesible online. \r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n se llevan a cabo conferencias y talleres creativos.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Stripmuseum","address_street_name":"Zandstraat","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zandstraat, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een wondere wereld vol strips\r\n\r\nHet Stripmuseum is een ontmoetingsplek voor alle stripliefhebbers in hartje Brussel.\r\nAan de hand van permanente tentoonstellingen \u2013 die regelmatig vernieuwd worden \u2013 en een afwisselend programma van tijdelijke expo's kan je er \r\nals bezoeker kennismaken met de talrijke facetten van het stripverhaal.\r\nDe Smurfen nemen je mee naar een land vol avonturen, waar de creativiteit geen grenzen kent.\r\nTalrijke originele platen, nooit eerder geziene documenten, decors in 3D en ludieke elementen worden verzameld \r\nom alle fans en liefhebbers van de Negende Kunst te kunnen boeien!\r\nHet uitzonderlijke art nouveau-gebouw van Victor Horta geeft een bezoek nog een extra dimensie. \r\nHet Stripmuseum brengt tegelijk een hommage aan de klassiekers van het medium en een blik op het hedendaagse stripverhaal.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":405,"location":{"lat":50.85107181,"lon":4.36006874},"last_updated_at":"2024-11-18T10:32:21+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/5b29c52ef4655276fbb325a322cce458b4da4434.jpg","width":1654,"height":2339,"ratio":0.71,"oEmbed_height":2339,"oEmbed_width":1654,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null}}},{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/26c60be909df1ab972f4c43f0f3340fc6b89a766.jpg","width":1654,"height":2339,"ratio":0.71,"oEmbed_height":2339,"oEmbed_width":1654,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Imbattable ! Au-del\u00e0 des cases","copyright":null},"en":{