Martin - Gabrielle Vincent: Een kunstenares met duizend facetten","shortdescr":"Een betoverende reis door het universum van Monique Martin\/Gabrielle Vincent, waar kunst, passie en veelzijdigheid elkaar ontmoeten in een onvergetelijke expo!\n\n","longdescr":null,"performers":"Op initiatief van de Dienst Cultuur in samenwerking met de stichting  \u2018Fondation Monique Martin\u2019. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.oudergem.be\/agenda","email":"dienstcultuur@oudergem.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 676 49 75","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004113"}},"place":{"id":259437,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Das sch\u00f6ne architektonische Ensemble des ehemaligen Klosters Rouge-Clo\u00eetre ist gewisserma\u00dfen die Pforte zum Soignes-Wald. Seinen Namen \u2013 zu Deutsch das rote Kloster \u2013 verdankt das Rouge-Clo\u00eetre der Farbe des M\u00f6rtels des Augustinerklosters, das hier im 14. Jahrhundert von M\u00f6nchen bewohnt und betrieben wurde. Das Priorat und einige der Geb\u00e4ude k\u00f6nnen noch heute besichtigt werden. \r\nDas Kloster ist von insgesamt f\u00fcnf Teichen umgeben, wobei die beiden gr\u00f6\u00dferen als Angelteiche genutzt werden, w\u00e4hrend die drei kleineren Naturschutzgebiet sind. Rund um das Kloster herum befinden sich ein Trimm-dich-Pfad sowie mehrere sch\u00f6ne Spielpl\u00e4tze, die zu den gr\u00f6\u00dften der Region z\u00e4hlen. Etwas weiter st\u00f6\u00dft man auf den experimentellen botanischen Garten von Jean Massart und seine Pflanzensammlungen, die der Forschung und Lehre dienen. \r\n\r\nAusstattung:\r\n-\tSitzb\u00e4nke\r\n-\tTaverne\r\n-\tSpielpl\u00e4tze (sowohl f\u00fcr kleinere (3-6 Jahre) als auch f\u00fcr gr\u00f6\u00dfere Kinder (6-12 Jahre))\r\n-\tTrimm-dich-Pfad\r\n-\tInfotafeln\r\n\r\nBarrierefreiheit\r\nDas Gel\u00e4nde ist f\u00fcr Rollstuhlfahrer mit Begleitperson zug\u00e4nglich.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"The Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, a place for walking and a gateway to the Soignes forest, is an architectural, forestry and natural complex of great wealth! It's an ancient bucolic site at the gates of the city! The site might owe its name to the colour of the plaster that covered the walls of the priory buildings, occupied since the second half of the 14th century by monks of the Order of Saint Augustine. The estate was once surrounded by a wall, which remains today. The remains of the priory and its outbuildings are still visible today. Today, the site is home to various organisations: the Art Centre, the Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Parole, non-profit organisation Cheval et For\u00eat, the Jardin des Moines and artists' studios. Two large ponds are still used for fishing, the other three are used as a nature reserve. The Rouge-Clo\u00eetre site has one of the largest and most modern playgrounds in the Brussels-Capital Region and a health trail. Not far from there, discover the Jean Massart experimental botanical garden, whose living collections are used for research and educational purposes. \r\n \r\nFacilities :  \r\n- Benches  \r\n- Taverne  \r\n- Playgrounds (3-6 years and 6-12 years)  \r\n- Health trail  \r\n- Informative signage \r\n \r\nDisabled access:  \r\nThe site is accessible to persons with reduced mobility, as long as they are accompanied.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Lieu de promenade et porte d\u2019entr\u00e9e vers la for\u00eat de Soignes, le Rouge-Clo\u00eetre forme un ensemble architectural, forestier et naturel d\u2019une grande richesse, vestige bucolique aux portes de la ville\u202f! Ce lieu-dit doit peut-\u00eatre son nom \u00e0 la couleur de l\u2019enduit qui recouvrait les murs des constructions du prieur\u00e9, occup\u00e9 depuis la deuxi\u00e8me moiti\u00e9 du 14e si\u00e8cle par des moines de l\u2019ordre de saint-Augustin. Le domaine est jadis ceint d\u2019un mur, qui subsiste de nos jours. On peut encore apercevoir les vestiges du prieur\u00e9 et ses d\u00e9pendances. Actuellement, le site loge diff\u00e9rents organismes\u202f. le Centre d\u2019Art, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Parole, l\u2019asbl Cheval et For\u00eat, le Jardin des Moines et des ateliers d\u2019artistes. Deux grands \u00e9tangs sont encore d\u00e9di\u00e9s \u00e0 la p\u00eache, les trois autres servent de r\u00e9serve naturelle. Le site de Rouge-Clo\u00eetre compte l\u2019une des plaines de jeux parmi les plus grandes et les plus modernes de la R\u00e9gion bruxelloise, ainsi qu\u2019un parcours sant\u00e9. Non loin de l\u00e0, d\u00e9couvrez le jardin botanique exp\u00e9rimental Jean Massart dont les collections vivantes sont destin\u00e9es \u00e0 la recherche et \u00e0 l\u2019enseignement.  \r\n \r\nEquipements :  \r\n- Bancs  \r\n- Taverne  \r\n- Plaines de jeux (3-6 ans et 6-12 ans)  \r\n- Parcours sant\u00e9  \r\n- Panneaux d\u2019information  \r\n \r\nAccessibilit\u00e9 :  \r\nLe site est accessible pour les personnes moins valides \u00e0 condition d\u2019\u00eatre accompagn\u00e9e.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Rouge Clo\u00eetre","address_street_name":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Rue du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, 7","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Rood Klooster","address_street_name":"Rokloosterstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.rouge-cloitre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Oudergem","address_line1":"Rokloosterstraat, 7","address_line2":"1160 Oudergem","description_web":"Het Rood Klooster is een mooie wandelomgeving die uitmondt in het Zoni\u00ebnwoud. Het is een architecturaal, bosbouwkundig en natuurlijk complex van grote rijkdom. Deze plaats dankt zijn naam wellicht aan de kleur van het pleisterwerk op de muren van de priorijgebouwen, die sinds de tweede helft van de 14e eeuw werden bewoond door monniken van de orde van Sint-Augustinus. Het landgoed was omringd door een muur, die er nu nog staat. De overblijfselen van de priorij en de bijgebouwen zijn er ook nog te bewonderen. Tegenwoordig herbergt de locatie verschillende organisaties: het Kunstcentrum, het Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Parole, de vzw Paard en Bos en kunstenaarsateliers. Er zijn twee grote visvijvers, de andere drie dienen als natuurreservaat. Het Rood Klooster beschikt tevens over een van de grootste en modernste speelpleinen van het Brussels Gewest, evenals een fitnessparcours. Niet ver daarvandaan kan je de experimentele botanische tuin Jean Massart ontdekken, waarvan de levende collecties worden gebruikt voor onderzoek en onderwijs.  \r\n\r\nFaciliteiten:\r\n- Banken  \r\n- Taverne  \r\n- Speeltuinen (3-6 jaar en 6-12 jaar)  \r\n- Gezondheidsparcours  \r\n- Informatieborden  \r\n\r\nToegankelijkheid personen met beperkte mobiliteit:\r\nDe site is toegankelijk voor personen met beperkte mobiliteit, mits zij worden begeleid.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":19437,"location":{"lat":50.81434148,"lon":4.44283848},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-04-16T12:10:18+02:00","published_at":"2014-10-04T10:53:28+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":268057,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison Communale d'Auderghem","address_street_name":"rue E. Idier","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"rue E. Idier, 12","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison Communale d'Auderghem","address_street_name":"rue E. Idier","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"rue E. Idier, 12","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Maison Communale d'Auderghem","address_street_name":"rue E. Idier","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"rue E. Idier, 12","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtua