]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"pt":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"en":{"name":"Anime art from the 1980's","shortdescr":"From November 15, 2024, to January 18, 2025, in Brussels, Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e is organizing a major retrospective exhibition and sale of original animation drawings from the 1980s. And it's a world first!\n","longdescr":"For the very first time, an art gallery is exhibiting and selling original drawings by Japanese animators used to create the most famous cartoons of the 80s.\n\nThis exceptional exhibition-sale brings together unique works of art: production drawings (dogas) and cels. With among others works by Space Captain Harlock, Captain Future, Candy, Candy, Saint Seiya -  The Knights of the Zodiac, Dragon Ball, UFO Robot Grendizer, Hokuto No Ken, Lamu, Princess Sara, Ranma \u00bd, ...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"it":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"cn":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"fr":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":"Du 15 novembre 2024 au 18 janvier 2025, \u00e0 Bruxelles, la Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e organise une grande exposition-vente r\u00e9trospective de dessins originaux d\u2019animation des ann\u00e9es 80. Et c\u2019est une premi\u00e8re mondiale !","longdescr":"Pour la toute premi\u00e8re fois, une galerie d\u2019art expose et vend les dessins originaux des animateurs japonais ayant servi \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80.\n\nCette exposition-vente exceptionnelle rassemble des \u0153uvres d\u2019art uniques : dessins de production (dogas) et cellulos. Avec entre autres des \u0153uvres d\u2019Albator, Capitaine Flam, Candy, Les Chevaliers du Zodiaque, Dragon Ball, Goldorak, Ken le survivant, Lamu, Princesse Gigi,Princesse Sara, Ranma \u00bd, R\u00e9mi sans famille, \u2026","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"sp":{"name":"Dessins anim\u00e9s des ann\u00e9es 80","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"},"nl":{"name":"Animation art from the 1980's","shortdescr":"Van 15 november 2024 tot 18 januari 2025 organiseert de Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e in Brussel een grote overzichtstentoonstelling en verkoop van originele animatietekeningen uit de jaren 80. En het is een wereldprimeur!\n","longdescr":"Voor de allereerste keer exposeert en verkoopt een kunstgalerie originele tekeningen van Japanse animators die zijn gebruikt om de beroemdste tekenfilms uit de jaren 80 te maken.\n\nDeze uitzonderlijke tentoonstellingsverkoop brengt unieke kunstwerken samen: productietekeningen (doga's) en cels. Met onder meer werken van Space Captain Harlock, Captain Future, Candy, Candy, Saint Seiya -  The Knights of the Zodiac, Dragon Ball, UFO Robot Grendizer, Hokuto No Ken, Lamu, Princess Sara, Ranma \u00bd, ...","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com\/expositions\/animation-japonaise-les-dessins-animes-des-annees-80\/","email":"info@galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002703"}},"place":{"id":271230,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Based in the heart of Brussels, close to the European District, the gallery specializes in the exhibition, sale and purchase of original comic and illustration art.\r\nWhether you\u2019ve been fond of comic books since childhood or are just discovering this fantastic medium, we offer a selection of more than a thousand pieces from well-known and up-and-coming comic book artists, both European and American. We also showcase the art of children\u2019s book illustrators.","description_print":"Based in the heart of Brussels, close to the European District, the Comic Art Factory gallery specializes in the exhibition, sale and purchase of original comic and illustration art.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019ve been fond of comic books since childhood or are just discovering this fantastic medium, we offer a selection of more than a thousand pieces from well-known and up-and-coming comic book artists, both European and American. We also showcase the art of children\u2019s book illustrators.\r\nWe offer consulting services on how to build a collection, and are always interested in buying great pieces of art.\r\n\r\nIt would be a pleasure to have you at our gallery, where you can see our passion for sequential art firsthand. We\u2019re open Thursday through Saturday, 1 PM to 7 PM, as well as other days by appointment.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre ","address_street_number":"237","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@galeriebd.com","website":"https:\/\/www.galeriebd.com","phone_contact":"+32 485 98 56 18","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre , 237","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, proche du Quartier Europ\u00e9en, La Galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans l\u2019exposition, l\u2019achat et la vente de dessins BD originaux, de planches originales de bande dessin\u00e9e, d\u2019illustrations originales, de cellulos de dessins anim\u00e9s et de crayonn\u00e9s d\u2019animation japonaise (layouts, dogas, gengas).\n  \nFr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Lorge, le directeur de la galerie, qu\u2019il a cr\u00e9\u00e9e en 2014, est membre de la Chambre belge des experts en bandes dessin\u00e9es.\n\nQue vous soyez passionn\u00e9s de bande dessin\u00e9e, lectrice ou lecteur occasionnel, fan de BD franco-belge, de comics am\u00e9ricains, ou de mangas, nous vous proposons plus d\u2019un millier d\u2019\u0153uvres d\u2019art disponibles \u00e0 la vente. Nous vous recevrons avec plaisir, et partagerons avec vous notre passion pour le neuvi\u00e8me art et l\u2019animation japonaise.\n","description_print":"Situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, proche du Quartier Europ\u00e9en, la galerie d\u2019art Comic Art Factory est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans l\u2019exposition, l\u2019achat et la vente de planches originales de bande dessin\u00e9e et d\u2019illustrations originales.\r\n\r\nQue vous soyez passionn\u00e9s de bande dessin\u00e9e, lectrice ou lecteur occasionnel, fan de BD franco-belge ou de comics am\u00e9ricains, nous vous proposons d\u2019acheter les planches BD et les illustrations originales d\u2019autrices et d\u2019auteurs de bande dessin\u00e9e, prometteurs ou confirm\u00e9s.\r\nNous proposons \u00e9galement un service de conseil pour celles et ceux qui souhaitent commencer une collection ou l\u2019affiner.\r\n\r\nNous sommes ouverts du jeudi au samedi, de 13 \u00e0 19h. Les autres jours sur rendez-vous. Nous vous recevrons avec plaisir, et partagerons avec vous notre passion pour le neuvi\u00e8me art.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La galerie de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre 