culte, un \u00e9v\u00e8nement que tout le monde attend avec impatience et qui ne manque jamais de faire vibrer le public.","longdescr":"Depuis 2012, le collectif bruxellois \u00ab Sysmo \u00bb invite la population \u00e0 une f\u00eate devenue mythique.\n\nPour ce concert au Botanique, afin de rendre la f\u00eate encore plus folle, Sysmo propose une collaboration in\u00e9dite au groupe \u00ab Steffi Graff \u00bb.\n\nAu programme, une transe groove et electro dans laquelle les deux groupes se chevauchent et se rejoignent sur sc\u00e8ne pour un set de 2H30 de musique non-stop !\n\nPour l\u2019occasion, Steffi Graff pr\u00e9sentera quelques morceaux de leur EP \u00ab  Let\u2019s Go \u00bb\n\nSYSMO, c\u2019est Un DJ set vivant d\u00e9livr\u00e9 par un ensemble de 14 percussionnistes, lib\u00e9rant des samples faits \u00e0 mains nues, model\u00e9s en temps r\u00e9el par un chef d\u2019orchestre. Sysmo est une r\u00e9volution du live, un ovni musical puissant, le shoot de rythme ultime, compos\u00e9 dans l\u2019instant.\n\n14 percussionnistes, un artiste invit\u00e9 et un chef d\u2019orchestre.\n\nC\u2019est simple, brut, puissant, et \u00e7a rassemble.\n\n \nSTEFFIG RAFF\n\nSTEFFIG RAFF, c\u2019est l\u2019histoire d\u2019une rencontre puissante comme une premi\u00e8re balle de service entre des musiciens bruxellois passionn\u00e9s de tennis et de gros sons rock, groove et electro. Le r\u00e9sultat, une fusion de style, \u00e0 la fois \u00e9lectronique et organique, qui puise son \u00e9nergie dans la transe moderne et traditionnelle, comme si le passing-shot et la vol\u00e9e haute de revers s\u2019unissaient le temps d\u2019un mouvement. Comme \u201clance-balles\u201d, des machines, des instruments acoustiques, saxophones, synth\u00e9tiseurs, guitare \u00e9lectrique, sampler, batterie, percussions.\n\nComme \u201craquette\u201d pour smasher ces ambiances, la voix du chanteur, puissante, expressive et sauvage comme un coup droit le long de la ligne. Professionnel, charismatique et esth\u00e9tique\u2026 d\u00e9couvrez les charmes et la pr\u00e9cision de STEFFIG RAFF et partez autour du monde avec eux gagner quelques grands chelems !\n\nIls pr\u00e9parent la sortie de leur premier EP, intitul\u00e9 \u201cLet\u2019s Go\u201d pour le mois de novembre  2024 ! STEFFIG RAFF est compos\u00e9 de Rafael Espinel \u00e0 la guitare et au chant, de Rapha\u00ebl Laguerre aux claviers et sampler, de Tuan Ho Duc aux saxophones acoustiques et \u00e9lectroniques et de Daniel Millan","performers":"Sysmo et Steffig Raff","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sysmo.be\/agenda\/241214smo\/","email":"hello@sysmo.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003347"},"sp":{"name":"Sysmo ft. Steffig Raff @ Botanique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sysmo.be\/agenda\/241214smo\/","email":"hello@sysmo.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003347"},"nl":{"name":"Sysmo ft. Steffig Raff","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sysmo.be\/agenda\/241214smo\/","email":"hello@sysmo.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003347"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"de":["Rogier"],"pt":[null],"en":["Rogier"],"it":["Rogier"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Rogier"],"sp":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.85461438,"lon":4.36620044},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-04-17T13:23:03+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":259462,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Matters Collective","address_street_name":"Rue Fernand Bernier","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@sysmo.be","website":"http:\/\/www.sysmo.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 543 44 49","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Fernand Bernier, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Matters Collective","address_street_name":"Rue Fernand Bernier","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@sysmo.be","website":"http:\/\/www.sysmo.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 543 44 49","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Fernand Bernier, 15","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Matters Collective","address_street_name":"Rue Fernand Bernier","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@sysmo