oris, Nicolas Ossowski, Guy Pion, Claude Semal, Babette Verbeek, et 4 enfants en alternance. ","performers":"Mise en sc\u00e8ne Patrice Mincke. Assistanat Sandrine Bonjean. Sc\u00e9nographie et costumes Ronald Beurms\nMusique originale Laurent Beumier. Vid\u00e9os Allan Beurms. Lumi\u00e8res Alain Collet. Maquillages et coiffures Urteza Da Fonseca, Florence Jasselette. Coaching vocal Daphn\u00e9 D\u2019Heur. Un spectacle du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Parc et du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de l\u2019\u00c9veil.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatreduparc.be\/","email":"Billetterie@theatreduparc.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 505 30 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000407"},"sp":{"name":"Le No\u00ebl de Mr Scrooge","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatreduparc.be\/","email":"Billetterie@theatreduparc.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 505 30 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000407"},"nl":{"name":"Le No\u00ebl de Mr Scrooge","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.theatreduparc.be\/","email":"Billetterie@theatreduparc.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 505 30 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000407"}},"place":{"id":331,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal du Parc","address_street_name":"Rue de la Loi","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatreduparc.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatreduparc.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 505 30 30","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Loi, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Th