m\u00e9li- m\u00e9lo de LPs, sans parler d\u2019\u00e9ventuelles surprises et impr\u00e9vus\u2026\n\nIl y a des polyphonies intimistes, du rythme, de l\u2019humour, des m\u00e9lodies qui invitent le public \u00e0 participer. On y parle des \u00e9toiles, des orangs-outans, des trous noirs et des vaches, des pommes d\u2019arrosoir, d\u2019une Reine qui s\u2019appelle Claude, etc.\n\nBref, un d\u00e9licieux bazar bizarre !","performers":"Tomassenko A4: Catherine Delaunay, clarinettes \/ Guillaume Roy, alto \/ Louis Evrard, guitare \/ Olivier Thomas, chant Tomassenko & Ze Pocket Koral: Wenke Minne, Fantine Baonville, Sara Moonen, Lydie Thonnard, Florence Meessen, Olivier Thomas\n\nproduction: Tomassenko","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.le140.be\/spectacles\/tomassenko-a4-ze-pocket-koral\/","email":"tickets@le140.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 97 08","phone_booking":"+32 470 67 56 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003470"},"sp":{"name":"Tomassenko A4 & The Pocket Koral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.le140.be\/spectacles\/tomassenko-a4-ze-pocket-koral\/","email":"tickets@le140.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 97 08","phone_booking":"+32 470 67 56 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003470"},"nl":{"name":"Tomassenko A4 & The Pocket Koral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.le140.be\/spectacles\/tomassenko-a4-ze-pocket-koral\/","email":"tickets@le140.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 97 08","phone_booking":"+32 470 67 56 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003470"}},"place":{"id":111,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le 140","address_street_name":"Avenue Eug\u00e8ne Plasky","address_street_number":"140","address_street_box":null,"email":"tickets@le140.be","website":"http:\/\/www.le140.be","phone_co