null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"},"it":{"name":"Ma Andi Mangoul","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"},"cn":{"name":"Ma Andi Mangoul","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"},"fr":{"name":"Ma Andi Mangoul","shortdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir un spectacle unique qui m\u00eale humour grin\u00e7ant, th\u00e9\u00e2tre documentaire et cuisine. En discutant des violences polici\u00e8res autour d'un tajine, pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 rire, r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir et questionner votre r\u00f4le dans le syst\u00e8me. R\u00e9servez vite pour cette exp\u00e9rience th\u00e9\u00e2trale sign\u00e9e Ras El Hanout.","longdescr":"Est-ce qu'on vous a d\u00e9j\u00e0 propos\u00e9 de d\u00e9battre des violences polici\u00e8res en vous cuisinant  un tajine? \nNon? \u00e7a vous tente? \nAlors, venez d\u00e9couvrir un spectacle unique ou l'humour grin\u00e7ant et le th\u00e9\u00e2tre documentaire se m\u00ealent \u00e0 la cuisine ! \nPr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 rire, r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir, et peut-\u00eatre m\u00eame \u00e0 remettre en question votre r\u00f4le dans le syst\u00e8me. \nR\u00e9servez vite pour ne pas manquer de g\u00f4uter \u00e0 cette exp\u00e9rience th\u00e9\u00e2trale \u00e0 la sauce Ras El Hanout ","performers":"Texte : Mohamed ALLOUCHI et Mohamed Salim HAOUACH\nSc\u00e9nographie et dramaturgie : Zenel LACI \/ R\u00e9gie Mahir : MOURNIN\nCoproduction : RAS EL HANOUT et ZINNEMA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"},"sp":{"name":"Ma Andi Mangoul","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"},"nl":{"name":"Ma Andi Mangoul","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/ma-andi-mangoul\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":"+32 488 01 14 11","phone_booking":"+32 488 01 14 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012350"}},"place":{"id":237040,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Espace Toots","address_street_name":"Rue Edouard Stuckens","address_street_number":"125","address_street_box":null,"email":"espacetoots@evere.irisnet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ESpacetoots\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 241 15 83","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1140","address_city":"Evere","address_line1":"Rue Edouard Stuckens, 125","address_line2":"1140 Evere","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Espace Toots","address_street_name":"Rue Edouard Stuckens","address_street_number":"125","address_street_box":null,"email":"espacetoots@evere.irisnet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ESpacetoots\/","phone