ps:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"en":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":"\nWelcome to Kids Winter Wonderland! Enjoy inflatable castles, laser tag, a fun disco, magical face painting, an eco-friendly ice rink, and shows. Relax with treats at the winter bar and food trucks. A magical day at Tour & Taxis awaits !","longdescr":"Welcome to Kids Winter Wonderland, the winter paradise for children ! Enjoy 2,000 m\u00b2 of inflatable castles, a laser tag course, and a fun disco for little dancers. Transform with magical face painting, glide on the eco-friendly ice rink, and watch circus, clown, and puppet shows. Relax at the cinema or in the play areas and creative workshops, while savoring treats at the winter bar and food trucks. A magical day awaits you at Tour & Taxis !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"it":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"cn":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"fr":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":"Bienvenue \u00e0 Kids Winter Wonderland ! Profitez de ch\u00e2teaux gonflables, de parcours de laser game, d\u2019une discoth\u00e8que fun, de maquillage f\u00e9erique, d\u2019une patinoire \u00e9cologique et de spectacles. D\u00e9tendez-vous au bar d\u2019hiver et aux foodtrucks. Une journ\u00e9e magique vous attend \u00e0 Tour & Taxis !","longdescr":"Bienvenue \u00e0 Kids Winter Wonderland, le paradis hivernal des enfants ! Profitez de 2.000 m\u00b2 de ch\u00e2teaux gonflables, d\u2019un parcours de tir au laser et d\u2019une discoth\u00e8que fun pour petits danseurs. Transformez-vous avec du maquillage f\u00e9erique, glissez sur la patinoire \u00e9cologique, et assistez \u00e0 des spectacles de cirque, de clowns et de marionnettes. D\u00e9tendez-vous au cin\u00e9ma ou dans nos espaces de jeux et ateliers cr\u00e9atifs, tout en savourant des gourmandises au bar d\u2019hiver et aux foodtrucks. Une journ\u00e9e magique vous attend \u00e0 Tour & Taxis !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"sp":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"},"nl":{"name":"Kids Winter Wonderland","shortdescr":"Welkom bij Kids Winter Wonderland ! Geniet van opblaaskastelen, laser tag, een gezellige disco, magisch schminken, een ecologische ijsbaan en shows. Ontspan met lekkernijen bij de winterbar en foodtrucks. Een magische dag wacht op je bij Tour & Taxis !","longdescr":"Welkom bij Kids Winter Wonderland, het winterparadijs voor kinderen ! Geniet van 2.000 m\u00b2 opblaaskastelen, een laser tag parcours en een leuke discotheek voor jonge dansers. Transformeer met magisch schminken, glijd over de ecologische ijsbaan en bekijk circus-, clown- en poppenshows. Ontspan in de bioscoop of in de speelhoeken en creatieve werkplaatsen, terwijl je geniet van lekkernijen bij de winterbar en foodtrucks. Een magische dag wacht op je bij Tour & Taxis !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.kidswinterwonderland.be\/","email":"info@kidswinterwonderland.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002524"}},"place":{"id":262737,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tour & Taxis Venues","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 c","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@tour-taxis.com","website":"http:\/\/www.tour-taxis.com\/meet-and-organise\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 421 50 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 c","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Tour & Taxis Venues","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 c","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@tour-taxis.com","website":"http:\/\/www.tour-taxis.com\/meet-and-organise\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 421 50 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 c","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Tour & Taxis Venues","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 c","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@tour-taxis.com","website":"http:\/\/www.tour-taxis.com\/meet-and-organise\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 421 50 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 c","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"BRUSSELS' EVENT HUB - WHERE INTERACTION IS PARAMOUNT AND WHERE STORIES ARE CREATED\r\nThis industrial heritage site where ironworks once facilitated the transportation of goods, now promises exciting new horizons. Tour & Taxis is a complete makeover of late 19th- early 20th century shipping and customs warehouses and goods train station. Its offer of multiple upscale adjacent event spaces \u2013 each with their different atmosphere, being for 2 or for 10.000 guests \u2013 includes Maison de la Poste, The Sheds, Produits Dangereux, Gare Maritime, Place de la Musique and Quai aux Poissons. \r\n\r\nCongresses, conferences, meetings, trainings, receptions and dinners, exhibitions and fairs, festivals, product launches and other events besides\u2026 memorable events happen here! \r\n\r\nTour & Taxis aim is to provide a safe environment that is as welcoming as it is committed to sustainability, inclusivity, and accessibility. The huge multi-purpose pedestrian area is designed for the future, but with the charm of the past \u2013 a heritage to be claimed by many future generations.  \r\n\r\nView our Covid-19 measures: https:\/\/tour-taxis.com\/meet-and-organise\/covid-19-measures\/ ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=YMTYGKDXuow","visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Tour & Taxis Venues","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 c","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@tour-taxis.com","website":"http:\/\/www.tour-taxis.com\/meet-and-organise\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 421 50 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Avenue du Port, 86 c","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Tour & Taxis Venues","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"86 c","address_street_box":null,"email":"welcome@tour-taxis.com","website":"http:\/\/www.tour-taxis.com\/meet-