was once considered the countryside. Today, the nearby Botanical Garden of Brussels exists as a reminder of that pastoral era. Hotel Indigo pays tribute as well with 284 boutique rooms, each featuring one of three garden-inspired themes: floral, herbal, and tropical. While the Botanical Garden's greenhouses now operate as cultural spaces rather than the cutting-edge botany labs of its past, the area's link to science continues with the European Research Council located just next door. Hotel Indigo celebrates this cultural fusion of horticulture and urban life, from its decor to the unique, green dining experiences at SERRA. \r\nWe use SERRA for most of our events, such as Afterworks with our DJ, Terarrium Tribe workshops, Cocktail Masterclass, and Art & Joy sessions, but also for corporate events! (Walking Buffet, dinner, cocktails...)\r\nThe SERRA concept, style and personality don\u2019t go unnoticed, and is one of the favourite locations in Brussels for impactful, unforgettable events!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Hotel Indigo Brussels City","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@indigobrusselscity.com","website":"https:\/\/www.ihg.com\/hotelindigo\/hotels\/gb\/en\/brussels\/brupr\/hoteldetail","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 31 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier, 20","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Hotel Indigo Brussels City ","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@indigobrusselscity.com","website":"https:\/\/www.ihg.com\/hotelindigo\/hotels\/gb\/en\/brussels\/brupr\/hoteldetail","phone_contact":"+32