00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"},"it":{"name":"Contes d'hiver et de No\u00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"},"cn":{"name":"Contes d'hiver et de No\u00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"},"fr":{"name":"Contes d'hiver et de No\u00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Bienvenue au Mus\u00e9e, pour \u00e9couter quelques histoires \u00e9pic\u00e9es, racont\u00e9es devant des peintures o\u00f9 le r\u00e9el et le merveilleux se m\u00e9langent.  \n\nD\u00e9velopper notre imaginaire, jouer avec les mots, cr\u00e9er des liens \u00e9motionnels forts et s\u2019ouvrir au monde. Les r\u00e9cits aident \u00e0 grandir, \u00e0 r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir et \u00e0 s\u2019amuser !\n\nChantal Denis et ses petits complices  - marionnettes, petits personnages en tissus - vous racontent\n\nLe No\u00ebl du petit h\u00e9risson\nLe Loup et le P\u00e8re No\u00ebl\nLa moufle\n\nPublic cible : 2 ans et demi \u00e0 5 ans, fr\u00e8res et s\u0153urs bienvenu.e.s s'il reste de la place. \n\n12\u20ac : adultes (entr\u00e9e comprise) \nEntr\u00e9e gratuite pour les enfants ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"},"sp":{"name":"Contes d'hiver et de No\u00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"},"nl":{"name":"Contes d'hiver et de No\u00ebl","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/12\/27\/contes-d-hiver-et-de-noel-fr","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002432"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmas